  - Name: upgrade
    Text: "N\xE2ng c\u1EA5p"
  - Name: buy_slot
    Text: "Mua 5 \xF4 ch\u1EE9a \u0111\u1ED3"
  - Name: sell
    Text: "B\xC1N"
  - Name: quest
    Text: "Nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EE5"
  - Name: equipment
    Text: "Thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB"
  - Name: update_soon
    Text: "S\u1EBD s\u1EDBm \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c c\u1EADp nh\u1EADt!"
  - Name: message
    Text: "Tin nh\u1EAFn"
  - Name: equip
    Text: "Trang b\u1ECB"
  - Name: equip_des
    Text: "Trang b\u1ECB b\u1ED9 trang b\u1ECB n\xE0y \u0111\u1EC3 t\u0103ng ch\u1EC9
      s\u1ED1 cho anh h\xF9ng c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n v\xE0 gi\u1EA3i ph\xF3ng ti\u1EC1m
      n\u0103ng th\u1EF1c s\u1EF1 c\u1EE7a h\u1ECD!"
  - Name: time_left
    Text: "Th\u1EDDi gian c\xF2n l\u1EA1i"
  - Name: weekly_time_left
    Text: "Ph\u1EA7n th\u01B0\u1EDFng \u0110\u1EA5u tr\u01B0\u1EDDng h\xE0ng tu\u1EA7n
      trong"
  - Name: btn_claim
    Text: "Nh\u1EADn"
  - Name: btn_delete
    Text: "X\xF3a b\u1ECF"
  - Name: btn_max
    Text: "T\u1ED1i \u0111a"
  - Name: empty_mail
    Text: "H\u1ED9p th\u01B0 \u0111\u1EBFn c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n \u0111ang tr\u1ED1ng!"
  - Name: btn_claim_all
    Text: "Y\xEAu c\u1EA7u t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3"
  - Name: btn_del_all
    Text: "X\xF3a t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3"
  - Name: level_up
    Text: "N\xE2ng c\u1EA5p"
  - Name: star_up
    Text: "N\xE2ng c\u1EA5p sao"
  - Name: btn_evolve
    Text: "Ti\u1EBFn h\xF3a"
  - Name: evolve_des
    Text: "Con qu\xE1i v\u1EADt n\xE0y \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1EA1t \u0111\u1EBFn giai
      \u0111o\u1EA1n ti\u1EBFn h\xF3a cu\u1ED1i c\xF9ng."
  - Name: close
    Text: "\u0110\xF3ng"
  - Name: confirm
    Text: "X\xE1c nh\u1EADn"
  - Name: slot
    Text: "Ch\u1ED7"
  - Name: rewards
    Text: "Ph\u1EA7n th\u01B0\u1EDFng"
  - Name: daily_rewards
    Text: "*Ph\u1EA7n th\u01B0\u1EDFng h\xE0ng ng\xE0y*"
  - Name: attack
    Text: "T\u1EA5n c\xF4ng"
  - Name: power
    Text: "S\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh"
  - Name: monster_des_attack
    Text: "Ti\xEAu di\u1EC7t qu\xE1i v\u1EADt, gi\xE0nh chi\u1EBFn l\u1EE3i ph\u1EA9m
      hi\u1EBFm! Chi\u1EBFn th\u1EAFng s\u1EBD mang l\u1EA1i \u0111i\u1EC3m kinh
      nghi\u1EC7m quan tr\u1ECDng \u0111\u1EC3 l\xEAn c\u1EA5p v\xE0 c\u01A1 h\u1ED9i
      s\u1EDF h\u1EEFu c\xE1c v\u1EADt ph\u1EA9m v\xE0 trang b\u1ECB huy\u1EC1n tho\u1EA1i.
      B\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 s\u1EB5n s\xE0ng cho th\u1EED th\xE1ch ch\u01B0a?"
  - Name: outpost_des_attack
    Text: "Tr\xEAn kh\u1EAFp v\xF9ng \u0111\u1EA5t b\u1ECB chia c\u1EAFt, nhi\u1EC1u
      Ph\xE1o \u0111\xE0i n\u1EB1m d\u01B0\u1EDBi s\u1EF1 cai tr\u1ECB c\u1EE7a k\u1EBB
      th\xF9. M\u1ED7i Ph\xE1o \u0111\xE0i b\u1EA1n chi\u1EBFm \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      kh\xF4ng ch\u1EC9 b\u1EA3o v\u1EC7 v\u01B0\u01A1ng qu\u1ED1c m\xE0 c\xF2n t\u0103ng
      ph\u1EA7n th\u01B0\u1EDFng h\xE0ng ng\xE0y c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n. B\u1EA1n c\xE0ng
      ki\u1EC3m so\xE1t nhi\u1EC1u Ph\xE1o \u0111\xE0i, \u1EA3nh h\u01B0\u1EDFng
      v\xE0 chi\u1EBFn l\u1EE3i ph\u1EA9m c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n c\xE0ng l\u1EDBn."
  - Name: outpost_des_reward
    Text: "*B\u1EA1n chi\u1EBFm c\xE0ng nhi\u1EC1u Ph\xE1o \u0111\xE0i, ph\u1EA7n
      th\u01B0\u1EDFng h\xE0ng ng\xE0y c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n c\xE0ng l\u1EDBn. V\xE0o
      l\xFAc b\xECnh minh c\u1EE7a m\u1ED7i ng\xE0y m\u1EDBi (00:00 UTC), chi\u1EBFn
      l\u1EE3i ph\u1EA9m c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n s\u1EBD \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c t\u1ED5ng
      k\u1EBFt v\xE0 c\xF3 th\u1EC3 nh\u1EADn.*"
  - Name: outpost_occupied_title
    Text: "Ph\xE1o \u0111\xE0i kh\xF4ng kh\u1EA3 d\u1EE5ng"
  - Name: outpost_occupied_des
    Text: "Ph\xE1o \u0111\xE0i \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECB chi\u1EBFm \u0111\xF3ng."
  - Name: start
    Text: "B\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u"
  - Name: turn
    Text: "V\xF2ng"
  - Name: click_to_continue
    Text: "Nh\u1EA5p \u0111\u1EC3 ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c"
  - Name: claimed
    Text: "\u0110\xE3 nh\u1EADn"
  - Name: avatar
    Text: Avatar
  - Name: frame
    Text: Khung
  - Name: equipped
    Text: "\u0110\u01B0\u1EE3c trang b\u1ECB"
  - Name: lock
    Text: "Kh\xF3a"
  - Name: buy
    Text: Mua
  - Name: quit_des
    Text: "B\u1EA1n c\xF3 ch\u1EAFc ch\u1EAFn mu\u1ED1n tho\xE1t kh\xF4ng?"
  - Name: sell_des
    Text: "B\u1EA1n c\xF3 mu\u1ED1n b\xE1n s\u1EA3n ph\u1EA9m n\xE0y kh\xF4ng?"
  - Name: enter_username
    Text: "Nh\u1EADp t\xEAn ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\xF9ng..."
  - Name: enter_password
    Text: "Nh\u1EADp m\u1EADt kh\u1EA9u..."
  - Name: enter_username_mail
