  - Name: remember_me
    Text: "Nh\u1EDB m\u1EADt kh\u1EA9u"
  - Name: continue
    Text: "Ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c"
  - Name: play_guest
    Text: "Ch\u01A1i v\u1EDBi t\u01B0 c\xE1ch kh\xE1ch!"
  - Name: want_to_buy_slots
    Text: "B\u1EA1n c\xF3 mu\u1ED1n th\xEAm 5 \xF4 ch\u1EE9a \u0111\u1ED3 v\u1EDBi:"
