  - Name: link_account
    Text: "T\u1EA1o t\xE0i kho\u1EA3n"
  - Name: link_account_btn
    Text: "Li\xEAn k\u1EBFt"
  - Name: linked_account_btn
    Text: "Li\xEAn k\u1EBFt"
  - Name: linked_account_notic
    Text: "T\xE0i kho\u1EA3n Myrk {0} c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      li\xEAn k\u1EBFt th\xE0nh c\xF4ng."
  - Name: link_account_not_login
    Text: "Vui l\xF2ng \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1EADp \u0111\u1EC3 ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c."
  - Name: link_account_title
    Text: "T\u1EA1o t\xE0i kho\u1EA3n"
  - Name: link_account_warrning
    Text: "B\u1EA1n \u0111ang ch\u01A1i v\u1EDBi t\u01B0 c\xE1ch kh\xE1ch. Vui l\xF2ng
      li\xEAn k\u1EBFt t\xE0i kho\u1EA3n c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n \u0111\u1EC3 tr\xE1nh
      m\u1EA5t d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u. V\xE0o C\xE0i \u0111\u1EB7t (g\xF3c tr\xEAn b\xEAn
      ph\u1EA3i m\xE0n h\xECnh) v\xE0 nh\u1EA5n n\xFAt Li\xEAn k\u1EBFt."
  - Name: land
    Text: "\u0110\u1EA5t"
  - Name: race_name_0
    Text: Gaia
  - Name: race_name_1
    Text: Mechtronic
  - Name: race_name_2
    Text: Nepharian
  - Name: race_name_3
    Text: Emberfolk
  - Name: race_name_4
    Text: Arcanian
  - Name: race_name_5
    Text: Shifterian
  - Name: race_detail_0
    Text: "C\u01B0 d\xE2n c\u1EE7a Gaia, m\u1ED9t h\xE0nh tinh gi\u1ED1ng Tr\xE1i
      \u0110\u1EA5t, nh\u1EEFng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi n\xE0y c\xF3 m\u1ED1i li\xEAn h\u1EC7
      s\xE2u s\u1EAFc v\u1EDBi thi\xEAn nhi\xEAn v\xE0 \u0111\u1ED9ng v\u1EADt. H\u1ECD
      giao ti\u1EBFp v\u1EDBi \u0111\u1ED9ng v\u1EADt v\xE0 s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng ph\xE9p
      thu\u1EADt c\u1EE7a Tr\xE1i \u0110\u1EA5t \u0111\u1EC3 thao t\xFAng th\u1EBF
      gi\u1EDBi t\u1EF1 nhi\xEAn."
  - Name: race_detail_1
    Text: "M\u1ED9t ch\u1EE7ng t\u1ED9c \u0111i\u1EC1u khi\u1EC3n h\u1ECDc s\u1ED1ng
      tr\xEAn m\u1ED9t h\xE0nh tinh c\xF4ng ngh\u1EC7 cao v\u1EDBi n\u1EC1n v\u0103n
      minh ti\xEAn ti\u1EBFn. C\u01A1 th\u1EC3 c\u1EE7a h\u1ECD l\xE0 nh\u1EEFng
      c\u1EA5u tr\xFAc c\u01A1 kh\xED, robot v\xE0 tr\xED tu\u1EC7 nh\xE2n t\u1EA1o.
      S\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh c\u1EE7a h\u1ECD n\u1EB1m \u1EDF s\u1EF1 s\xE1ng t\u1EA1o
      v\xE0 hi\u1EC3u bi\u1EBFt s\xE2u s\u1EAFc v\u1EC1 c\xF4ng ngh\u1EC7."
  - Name: race_detail_2
    Text: "Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ngo\xE0i h\xE0nh tinh \u0111\u1EBFn t\u1EEB m\u1ED9t h\xE0nh
      tinh xa x\xF4i v\u1EDBi m\xF4i tr\u01B0\u1EDDng kh\u1EAFc nghi\u1EC7t. H\u1ECD
      c\xF3 l\xE0n da xanh v\xE0 c\xF3 th\u1EC3 khai th\xE1c s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh c\u1EE7a
      c\xE1c nguy\xEAn t\u1ED1 n\u01B0\u1EDBc. H\u1ECD l\xE0 nh\u1EEFng chi\u1EBFn
      binh \u0111\xE1ng g\u1EDDm v\xE0 nhanh nh\u1EB9n trong m\xF4i tr\u01B0\u1EDDng
      n\u01B0\u1EDBc."
  - Name: race_detail_3
    Text: "C\u01B0 d\xE2n c\u1EE7a m\u1ED9t h\xE0nh tinh nhi\u1EC7t \u0111\u1EDBi,
      n\u01A1i nhi\u1EC7t v\xE0 l\u1EEDa l\xE0 m\u1ED9t ph\u1EA7n kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3
      thi\u1EBFu trong cu\u1ED9c s\u1ED1ng h\xE0ng ng\xE0y. H\u1ECD c\xF3 th\u1EC3
      t\u1EA1o ra v\xE0 \u0111i\u1EC1u khi\u1EC3n l\u1EEDa, s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng n\xF3
      nh\u01B0 m\u1ED9t ph\xE9p thu\u1EADt ho\u1EB7c v\u0169 kh\xED. N\u1EC1n v\u0103n
      h\xF3a thi\xEAng li\xEAng c\u1EE7a h\u1ECD t\xF4n k\xEDnh c\xE1c v\u1ECB th\u1EA7n
      li\xEAn quan \u0111\u1EBFn l\u1EEDa v\xE0 nhi\u1EC7t."
  - Name: race_detail_4
    Text: "M\u1ED9t ch\u1EE7ng t\u1ED9c si\xEAu vi\u1EC7t c\xF3 kh\u1EA3 n\u0103ng
      \u0111i\u1EC1u khi\u1EC3n n\u0103ng l\u01B0\u1EE3ng v\u0169 tr\u1EE5 v\xE0
      ma thu\u1EADt. H\u1ECD s\u1ED1ng tr\xEAn m\u1ED9t h\xE0nh tinh c\xF3 b\u1EA7u
      kh\xED quy\u1EC3n \u0111\u1ED9c \u0111\xE1o cho ph\xE9p h\u1ECD h\u1EA5p th\u1EE5
      n\u0103ng l\u01B0\u1EE3ng v\xE0 ma thu\u1EADt t\u1EEB c\xE1c ng\xF4i sao v\xE0
      c\xE1c h\xE0nh tinh l\xE2n c\u1EADn. H\u1ECD l\xE0 nh\u1EEFng ph\xF9 th\u1EE7y
      v\u1EDBi ki\u1EBFn \u200B\u200Bth\u1EE9c v\xF4 h\u1EA1n v\u1EC1 v\u0169 tr\u1EE5."
  - Name: race_detail_5
    Text: "M\u1ED9t ch\u1EE7ng t\u1ED9c c\xF3 kh\u1EA3 n\u0103ng bi\u1EBFn h\xECnh
      v\xE0 th\xEDch nghi c\u01A1 th\u1EC3 khi c\u1EA7n thi\u1EBFt. H\u1ECD s\u1ED1ng
      tr\xEAn m\u1ED9t h\xE0nh tinh \u0111\u1ED1i m\u1EB7t v\u1EDBi mu\xF4n v\xE0n
      m\u1ED1i \u0111e d\u1ECDa, v\xE0 kh\u1EA3 n\u0103ng bi\u1EBFn h\xECnh gi\xFAp
      h\u1ECD s\u1ED1ng s\xF3t v\xE0 th\xEDch nghi v\u1EDBi nh\u1EEFng \u0111i\u1EC1u
      ki\u1EC7n kh\u1EAFc nghi\u1EC7t. H\u1ECD linh ho\u1EA1t v\xE0 d\u1EC5 th\xEDch
      nghi, c\xF3 th\u1EC3 thay \u0111\u1ED5i h\xECnh d\u1EA1ng \u0111\u1EC3 ph\xF9
      h\u1EE3p v\u1EDBi m\u1ECDi ho\xE0n c\u1EA3nh."
  - Name: dont_enough_item
    Text: "B\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng \u0111\u1EE7 {0}!"
  - Name: dont_enough_item_title
    Text: "T\xE0i nguy\xEAn kh\xF4ng \u0111\u1EE7"
  - Name: warning_cap_slot_inventory_bag
    Text: "B\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1EA1t \u0111\u1EBFn s\u1ED1 l\u01B0\u1EE3ng
      v\u1EADt ph\u1EA9m t\u1ED1i \u0111a trong kho. Vui l\xF2ng m\u1EDF r\u1ED9ng
      kho \u0111\u1EC3 ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c."
  - Name: notify_cap_slot_inventory_bag
    Text: "T\xFAi c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1EA7y! Vui l\xF2ng d\u1ECDn
      s\u1EA1ch t\xFAi tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c."
  - Name: title_cap_slot_inventory_bag
    Text: "T\xFAi tr\xE0n \u0111\u1EA7y!"
  - Name: passive_skill_detail
    Text: "*K\u1EF9 n\u0103ng th\u1EE5 \u0111\u1ED9ng lu\xF4n t\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED9ng
      k\xEDch ho\u1EA1t d\u1EF1a tr\xEAn \u0111i\u1EC1u ki\u1EC7n.*"
  - Name: active_skill_detail
