    Text: "\u0110\u1ED9ng l\u1EF1c chi\u1EBFn \u0111\u1EA5u"
  - Name: skill_passive_detail_7
    Text: "T\u1EA5n c\xF4ng {0}% ATK \u0111\u1EBFn m\u1EE9c HP cao nh\u1EA5t c\u1EE7a
      k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch c\xF3 {1}% im l\u1EB7ng {2} v\xF2ng"
  - Name: skill_passive_name_8
    Text: "L\u1EF1c nghi\u1EC1n"
  - Name: skill_passive_detail_8
    Text: "T\u1EA5n c\xF4ng g\xE2y {0}% ATK v\xE0 ch\u1EA3y m\xE1u {1}% ATK theo
      v\xF2ng v\xE0 gi\u1EA3m {2} c\u01A1n th\u1ECBnh n\u1ED9"
  - Name: skill_passive_name_9
    Text: "Th\u1EBF ph\xF2ng th\u1EE7"
  - Name: skill_passive_detail_9
    Text: "Khi b\u1ECB \u0111\xE1nh tr\xFAng, c\xF3 {0}% c\u01A1 h\u1ED9i l\xE0m
      \u0111\xF4ng c\u1EE9ng k\u1EBB t\u1EA5n c\xF4ng trong {1} hi\u1EC7p."
  - Name: skill_passive_name_10
    Text: "S\u1EF1 gia t\u0103ng quan tr\u1ECDng"
  - Name: skill_passive_detail_10
    Text: "G\xE2y {0}% ATK cho k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch \u1EDF c\u1ED9t ph\xEDa tr\u01B0\u1EDBc
      v\xE0 ph\u1EE5c h\u1ED3i HP b\u1EB1ng {1}% ATK."
  - Name: skill_passive_name_11
    Text: "D\xF2ng ch\u1EA3y Mana"
  - Name: skill_passive_detail_11
    Text: "T\u1EA5n c\xF4ng {1} k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch ng\u1EABu nhi\xEAn, g\xE2y
      {0}% s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng ATK. \xC1p d\u1EE5ng hi\u1EC7u \u1EE9ng Thi\xEAu
      \u0111\u1ED1t, g\xE2y s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng chu\u1EA9n b\u1EB1ng {2}% HP
      t\u1ED1i \u0111a trong {3} hi\u1EC7p."
  - Name: skill_passive_name_12
    Text: "S\u1EF1 t\u01B0\u01A1ng th\xEDch b\xED \u1EA9n"
  - Name: skill_passive_detail_12
    Text: "T\u0103ng ATK th\xEAm {0}% v\xE0 HP {1}%. L\u1EA7n \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn
      HP gi\u1EA3m xu\u1ED1ng d\u01B0\u1EDBi {3}% HP, nh\u1EADn \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      {4}% Gi\u1EA3m s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng trong {5} v\xF2ng."
  - Name: skill_passive_name_13
    Text: Emberheart
  - Name: skill_passive_detail_13
