      v\xF2ng"
  - Name: skill_passive_name_14
    Text: "Linh h\u1ED3n b\u0103ng gi\xE1"
  - Name: skill_passive_detail_14
    Text: "G\xE2y th\xEAm {0}% s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng cho k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch
      \u0111ang ch\u1EA3y m\xE1u"
  - Name: skill_passive_name_15
    Text: "\u1ED0ng d\u1EABn s\xE9t"
  - Name: skill_passive_detail_15
    Text: "T\u0103ng HP {0}%, DEF {1}%"
  - Name: skill_passive_name_16
    Text: "S\u1EF1 bao b\u1ECDc c\u1EE7a thi\xEAn nhi\xEAn"
  - Name: skill_passive_detail_16
    Text: "T\u0103ng s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh t\u1EA5n c\xF4ng {0}%"
