  - Name: skill_passive_name_41
    Text: "Di s\u1EA3n b\u1ECB thi\xEAu r\u1EE5i"
  - Name: skill_passive_detail_41
    Text: "HP +{0}%, DEF+{1}%\r\nKhi ch\u1EBFt, gi\u1EA3i ph\xF3ng m\u1ED9t l\u1EDDi
