      th\u01B0\u01A1ng ATK v\xE0 b\u1ECF qua Ch\u1EB7n"
  - Name: skill_passive_name_44
    Text: "K\u1EBB s\u0103n m\u1ED3i b\u1ECDc th\xE9p"
  - Name: skill_passive_detail_44
    Text: "T\u0103ng HP th\xEAm {0}%, S\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng th\xEAm {1}%, T\u1ED1c
