  - Name: skill_passive_name_45
    Text: "Nu\u1ED1t ch\u1EEDng nh\u1EEFng k\u1EBB sa ng\xE3"
  - Name: skill_passive_detail_45
    Text: "M\u1ED7i khi k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch ch\u1EBFt, h\u1ED3i {0} N\u0103ng
      l\u01B0\u1EE3ng v\xE0 h\u1ED3i {1}% ATK. \u0110\u1ED3ng th\u1EDDi t\u0103ng
