  - Name: skill_passive_name_47
    Text: "Titan L\u1EEDa"
  - Name: skill_passive_detail_47
    Text: "T\u0103ng HP th\xEAm {0}%, ATK th\xEAm {1}% v\xE0 Gi\xE1p th\xEAm {2}%."
  - Name: skill_passive_name_48
    Text: "L\xF2 nung d\u1EEF d\u1ED9i"
  - Name: skill_passive_detail_48
    Text: "Trong {0} v\xF2ng \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn c\u1EE7a tr\u1EADn chi\u1EBFn,
      v\xE0o cu\u1ED1i m\u1ED7i v\xF2ng, t\u0103ng Ch\xED m\u1EA1ng c\u1EE7a b\u1EA3n
      th\xE2n th\xEAm {1}%, S\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng ch\xED m\u1EA1ng th\xEAm {2}%
      v\xE0 Ph\xE1 gi\xE1p th\xEAm {3}% trong {4} v\xF2ng."
  - Name: skill_passive_name_49
    Text: "Da \u0111\u1ED9c"
  - Name: skill_passive_detail_49
    Text: "S\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh \u0111\u1ED9c h\u1EA1i th\u1EA5m v\xE0o c\u01A1 th\u1EC3,
      c\u1EE7ng c\u1ED1 l\u1EDBp th\u1ECBt v\xE0 v\u1ECF, t\u0103ng HP th\xEAm {0}%
      v\xE0 Gi\xE1p th\xEAm {1}%."
  - Name: skill_passive_name_50
    Text: "Hi\u1EC7p \u01B0\u1EDBc Plagueborn"
  - Name: skill_passive_detail_50
    Text: "Tinh ch\u1EA5t \u0111\u1ED9c c\u1EE7a G\u1EA5u lan t\u1ECFa kh\u1EAFp
      chi\u1EBFn tr\u01B0\u1EDDng. M\u1ED7i khi \u0111\u1ED3ng minh t\u1EA5n c\xF4ng
      ch\xED m\u1EA1ng, G\u1EA5u s\u1EBD h\xFAt sinh l\u1EF1c qua l\xE0n kh\xF3i
      \u0111\u1ED9c, h\u1ED3i ph\u1EE5c HP b\u1EB1ng {0}% ATK c\u1EE7a n\xF3."
  - Name: skill_passive_name_51
    Text: "Mai \u0103n m\xF2n"
  - Name: skill_passive_detail_51
    Text: "Khi b\u1ECB t\u1EA5n c\xF4ng, c\u01A1 th\u1EC3 ch\u1EE9a n\u1ECDc \u0111\u1ED9c
      c\u1EE7a G\u1EA5u s\u1EBD gi\u1EA3i ph\xF3ng m\u1ED9t lu\u1ED3ng ph\u1EA3n
      \u1EE9ng \u0111\u1ED9c h\u1EA1i, l\xE0m gi\u1EA3m Gi\xE1p Ph\xE1 c\u1EE7a k\u1EBB
      t\u1EA5n c\xF4ng \u0111i {0}% v\xE0 g\xE2y \u0110\u1ED9c, g\xE2y ra {1}% s\xE1t
      th\u01B0\u01A1ng ATK m\u1ED7i hi\u1EC7p trong {2} hi\u1EC7p."
  - Name: skill_passive_name_52
    Text: "S\u1ED1c Ironbone"
  - Name: skill_passive_detail_52
    Text: "V\u1EDBi m\xF3ng vu\u1ED1t b\u1EB1ng x\u01B0\u01A1ng v\xE0 th\xE9p \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      bao b\u1ECDc trong ti\u1EBFng s\u1EA5m r\u1EC1n, c\xE1c \u0111\xF2n t\u1EA5n
      c\xF4ng c\u01A1 b\u1EA3n c\u1EE7a r\u1ED3ng g\xE2y ra {0}% s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng
      ATK v\xE0 c\xF3 {1}% c\u01A1 h\u1ED9i l\xE0m cho\xE1ng m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu trong
      {2} hi\u1EC7p."
  - Name: skill_passive_name_53
    Text: "D\xF2ng d\xF5i Stormborn"
  - Name: skill_passive_detail_53
    Text: "Sinh ra t\u1EEB d\xF2ng d\xF5i T\u1ED9c R\u1ED3ng v\xE0 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      bao b\u1ECDc trong c\u01A1n th\u1ECBnh n\u1ED9 v\u0129nh c\u1EEDu c\u1EE7a
      s\u1EA5m s\xE9t, con r\u1ED3ng th\u1EEBa h\u01B0\u1EDFng +{0}% HP, +{1}% S\xE1t
      th\u01B0\u01A1ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng v\xE0 +{2} T\u1ED1c \u0111\u1ED9."
  - Name: skill_passive_name_54
    Text: "S\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh b\u1ECB nguy\u1EC1n r\u1EE7a \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c gi\u1EA3i
      ph\xF3ng"
  - Name: skill_passive_detail_54
    Text: "Khi HP c\u1EE7a n\xF3 gi\u1EA3m xu\u1ED1ng d\u01B0\u1EDBi {1}% l\u1EA7n
      \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn, r\u1ED3ng s\u1EBD t\u1EEB b\u1ECF tr\u1EA1ng th\xE1i
      ph\xF2ng th\u1EE7. N\xF3 hy sinh {2}% DEF \u0111\u1EC3 nh\u1EADn th\xEAm {3}%
      ATK trong {4} hi\u1EC7p, gi\u1EA3i ph\xF3ng c\u01A1n th\u1ECBnh n\u1ED9 nguy\xEAn
      th\u1EE7y do b\xE3o t\u1ED1 t\u1EA1o n\xEAn."
  - Name: skill_passive_name_55
    Text: "Tr\xE1i tim c\u1EE7a \u0111\u1ECBa ng\u1EE5c"
  - Name: skill_passive_detail_55
    Text: "T\u0103ng HP th\xEAm {0}%, ATK th\xEAm {1}%, Crit th\xEAm {2}%."
  - Name: skill_passive_name_56
    Text: "S\u1EEBng r\u1EF1c l\u1EEDa"
  - Name: skill_passive_detail_56
    Text: "M\u1ED7i \u0111\xF2n t\u1EA5n c\xF4ng c\u01A1 b\u1EA3n \u0111\u1EC1u g\xE2y
      ra c\u01A1n th\u1ECBnh n\u1ED9 d\u1EEF d\u1ED9i, g\xE2y {0}% s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng
      ATK v\xE0 g\xE2y hi\u1EC7u \u1EE9ng B\u1ECFng, thi\xEAu \u0111\u1ED1t m\u1EE5c
      ti\xEAu v\u1EDBi {1}% s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng ATK m\u1ED7i hi\u1EC7p trong
      {2} hi\u1EC7p."
  - Name: skill_passive_name_57
    Text: "Ti\u1EBFng h\xFA \u0111\u1ECBa ng\u1EE5c"
  - Name: skill_passive_detail_57
    Text: "V\xE0o cu\u1ED1i m\u1ED7i hi\u1EC7p, n\xF3 s\u1EBD gi\u1EA3i ph\xF3ng
      nh\u1EEFng \u0111\u1EE3t l\u1EEDa thi\xEAu \u0111\u1ED1t t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 k\u1EBB
      \u0111\u1ECBch, g\xE2y {0}% s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng ATK m\u1ED7i hi\u1EC7p
      trong {1} hi\u1EC7p. B\u1EA3n th\xE2n chi\u1EBFn tr\u01B0\u1EDDng tr\u1EDF
      th\xE0nh \u0111\u1ECBa ng\u1EE5c d\u01B0\u1EDBi c\u01A1n th\u1ECBnh n\u1ED9
      c\u1EE7a n\xF3."
  - Name: skill_passive_name_58
    Text: "L\u1EDDi th\u1EC1 c\u1EE7a Wildwing"
  - Name: skill_passive_detail_58
    Text: "T\u0103ng HP th\xEAm {0}%, ATK th\xEAm {1}% v\xE0 kh\u1EA3 n\u0103ng h\u1ED3i
      ph\u1EE5c th\xEAm {2}%."
  - Name: skill_passive_name_59
    Text: "\xC1nh s\xE1ng r\u1EF1c r\u1EE1 c\u1EE7a Sylvan"
  - Name: skill_passive_detail_59
    Text: "Khi th\u1EF1c hi\u1EC7n \u0111\xF2n \u0111\xE1nh th\u01B0\u1EDDng, g\xE2y
      {0}% s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng c\xF4ng k\xEDch v\xE0 h\u1ED3i HP b\u1EB1ng {1}%
      c\xF4ng k\xEDch cho 1 \u0111\u1ED3ng minh ng\u1EABu nhi\xEAn, gi\xFAp h\u1ECD
      nh\u1EADn \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c hi\u1EC7u \u1EE9ng Verdant Grace trong {2} l\u01B0\u1EE3t.
      \r\nVerdant Grace: Khi m\u1ED9t t\u01B0\u1EDBng s\u1EDF h\u1EEFu Verdant Grace
      nh\u1EADn s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng ch\xED m\u1EA1ng, h\u1ECD s\u1EBD h\u1ED3i
      HP b\u1EB1ng {3}% c\xF4ng k\xEDch c\u1EE7a ng\u01B0\u1EDDi thi tri\u1EC3n.
      Hi\u1EC7u \u1EE9ng n\xE0y s\u1EBD h\u1EBFt sau khi k\xEDch ho\u1EA1t nh\u01B0ng
      c\xF3 th\u1EC3 c\u1ED9ng d\u1ED3n."
  - Name: skill_passive_name_60
    Text: "C\u01A1n th\u1ECBnh n\u1ED9 c\u1EE7a r\u1EEBng"
  - Name: skill_passive_detail_60
    Text: "Khi HP gi\u1EA3m xu\u1ED1ng d\u01B0\u1EDBi {0}% l\u1EA7n \u0111\u1EA7u
      ti\xEAn trong tr\u1EADn chi\u1EBFn, s\u1EBD tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh
      c\u1EE7a r\u1EEBng c\u1ED5 \u0111\u1EA1i, t\u0103ng ATK th\xEAm {1}% trong
      {2} v\xF2ng v\xE0 ph\u1EE5c h\u1ED3i HP b\u1EB1ng {3}% ATK."
