    Text: "G\xE2y {0}% s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng cho t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch
      v\xE0 c\xF3 {1}% c\u01A1 h\u1ED9i \u0111\xF3ng b\u0103ng ch\xFAng trong {2}
      hi\u1EC7p."
  - Name: skill_active_name_10
    Text: "Th\u1EDDi gian cong v\xEAnh"
  - Name: skill_active_detail_10
    Text: "G\xE2y {0}% s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng l\xEAn k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch c\xF3
      ATK cao nh\u1EA5t. \xC1p d\u1EE5ng c\u1ED9ng d\u1ED3n Dragon Slash, t\u0103ng
      s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng th\xEAm {1}% m\u1ED7i c\u1ED9ng d\u1ED3n."
  - Name: skill_active_name_11
    Text: "Ti\u1EBFng h\xFA \u0111en t\u1ED1i"
  - Name: skill_active_detail_11
    Text: "G\xE2y {0}% s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng l\xEAn k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch c\xF3
      HP cao nh\u1EA5t, c\u1ED9ng v\u1EDBi S\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng chu\u1EA9n b\u1EB1ng
      {1}% HP t\u1ED1i \u0111a c\u1EE7a ch\xFAng (t\u1ED1i \u0111a {2} ATK). Thi\xEAu
      \u0111\u1ED1t ch\xFAng v\u1EDBi {3}% S\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng chu\u1EA9n b\u1EB1ng
      HP t\u1ED1i \u0111a c\u1EE7a ch\xFAng trong {4} hi\u1EC7p."
  - Name: skill_active_name_12
    Text: "L\u01B0\u1EE1i dao l\u1ED1c xo\xE1y"
  - Name: skill_active_detail_12
    Text: "G\xE2y {0}% s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng cho t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch,
      h\u1ED3i m\xE1u cho \u0111\u1ED3ng minh c\xF3 HP th\u1EA5p nh\u1EA5t v\u1EDBi
      {1}% ATK v\xE0 c\xF3 {2}% c\u01A1 h\u1ED9i l\xE0m cho\xE1ng {3} k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch
      trong {4} hi\u1EC7p"
  - Name: skill_active_name_13
    Text: "L\u01B0\u1EE1i ch\xE9m Stormfang"
  - Name: skill_active_detail_13
    Text: "D\xF9ng l\u01B0\u1EE1i li\u1EC1m ch\xE9m xuy\xEAn qua h\xE0ng k\u1EBB
      \u0111\u1ECBch, g\xE2y {0}% s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng ATK. C\xF3 {1}% c\u01A1
      h\u1ED9i \u0111\xF3ng b\u0103ng k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch b\u1ECB \u1EA3nh h\u01B0\u1EDFng
      trong {2} hi\u1EC7p."
  - Name: skill_active_name_14
    Text: "\u0110\xF2n t\u1EA5n c\xF4ng b\u1EB1ng nanh k\xE9p"
  - Name: skill_active_detail_14
    Text: "Nh\u1EA3y v\xE0o h\xE0ng sau, g\xE2y {0}% s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng ATK.
      B\u1ECF qua hi\u1EC7u \u1EE9ng Ch\u1EB7n. G\xE2y hi\u1EC7u \u1EE9ng Gai Ch\u1EA3y
      M\xE1u, khi\u1EBFn m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu ch\u1ECBu th\xEAm {1}% s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng
      ATK m\u1ED7i l\u01B0\u1EE3t trong 2 l\u01B0\u1EE3t."
  - Name: skill_active_name_15
    Text: "Chi\u1EBFn tranh tr\xEAn bi\u1EC3n"
  - Name: skill_active_detail_15
    Text: "Tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i m\u1ED9t c\u01A1n b\xE3o r\xECu ma thu\u1EADt, gi\u1EA3i
      ph\xF3ng m\u1ED9t l\xE0n s\xF3ng s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh b\u0103ng gi\xE1. G\xE2y
      {0}% s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng ATK l\xEAn t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch,
      v\u1EDBi {1}% c\u01A1 h\u1ED9i \u0111\xF3ng b\u0103ng ch\xFAng trong {2} hi\u1EC7p."
  - Name: skill_active_name_16
    Text: "V\u1EE5 va ch\u1EA1m Flamefist"
  - Name: skill_active_detail_16
    Text: "Bao ph\u1EE7 \u0111\xF4i tay c\u1EE7a m\xECnh trong ng\u1ECDn l\u1EEDa
      thi\xEAu \u0111\u1ED1t v\xE0 t\u1EA5n c\xF4ng ra ngo\xE0i, gi\u1EA3i ph\xF3ng
      m\u1ED9t l\xE0n s\xF3ng l\u1EEDa thi\xEAu \u0111\u1ED1t t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 k\u1EBB
      \u0111\u1ECBch v\u1EDBi {0}% s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng ATK v\xE0 thi\xEAu \u0111\u1ED1t
      ch\xFAng v\u1EDBi {1}% ATK m\u1ED7i hi\u1EC7p trong {2} hi\u1EC7p."
  - Name: skill_active_name_17
    Text: "M\xE1y ch\xE9m Earthfang"
  - Name: skill_active_detail_17
    Text: "Tung \u0111\xF2n t\u1EA5n c\xF4ng v\xE0o hai k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch c\xF3
      HP th\u1EA5p nh\u1EA5t, g\xE2y {0}% s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng ATK. B\u1ECF qua
      hi\u1EC7u \u1EE9ng Ch\u1EB7n. G\xE2y th\xEAm s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng b\u1EB1ng
      {1}% l\u01B0\u1EE3ng HP \u0111\xE3 m\u1EA5t c\u1EE7a m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu (t\u1ED1i
      \u0111a {2}% ATK). N\u1EBFu HP c\u1EE7a m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu th\u1EA5p h\u01A1n
      nh\u1EC7n, c\xF3 {3}% c\u01A1 h\u1ED9i l\xE0m cho\xE1ng ch\xFAng trong {4}
      hi\u1EC7p."
  - Name: skill_active_name_18
    Text: "\u0110\u1EADp ph\xE1 Bullfire"
  - Name: skill_active_detail_18
    Text: "Tung ra m\u1ED9t c\xFA \u0111\xE1nh b\xFAa r\u1EF1c l\u1EEDa v\xE0o h\xE0ng
      tr\u01B0\u1EDBc, g\xE2y {0}% s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng c\xF4ng k\xEDch. T\u0103ng
      +{1}% c\xF4ng k\xEDch v\xE0 +{2}% ph\xE1 gi\xE1p trong {3} hi\u1EC7p. \u0110\u1ED3ng
      th\u1EDDi g\xE2y th\xEAm s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng b\u1EB1ng {4}% m\xE1u t\u1ED1i
      \u0111a c\u1EE7a m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu (s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng t\u1ED1i \u0111a
      b\u1ECB gi\u1EDBi h\u1EA1n \u1EDF {5}% c\xF4ng k\xEDch)."
  - Name: skill_active_name_19
    Text: "S\u0103n \u0110\u1ECBa Ng\u1EE5c"
  - Name: skill_active_detail_19
    Text: "Gi\u1EA3i ph\xF3ng m\u1ED9t l\xE0n s\xF3ng l\u1EEDa thi\xEAu \u0111\u1ED1t,
