      v\xE0 gi\u1EA3m T\u1ED1c \u0111\u1ED9 c\u1EE7a ch\xFAng \u0111i {1} trong {2}
      l\u01B0\u1EE3t."
  - Name: skill_active_name_20
    Text: "Ti\u1EBFng g\u1EA7m c\u1EE7a Bonequake"
  - Name: skill_active_detail_20
    Text: "Gi\u1EA3i ph\xF3ng m\u1ED9t ti\u1EBFng g\u1EA7m s\u1EA5m s\xE9t h\xF2a
      quy\u1EC7n v\u1EDBi \xE1nh s\xE1ng b\xE3o t\u1ED1, g\xE2y {0}% s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng
      ATK l\xEAn t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch. M\u1ED7i m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu
      c\xF3 {1}% kh\u1EA3 n\u0103ng b\u1ECB Cho\xE1ng trong {2} hi\u1EC7p v\xE0 {3}%
      kh\u1EA3 n\u0103ng m\u1EA5t {4} N\u0103ng l\u01B0\u1EE3ng."
  - Name: skill_active_name_21
    Text: "S\u0103n \u0110\u1ECBa Ng\u1EE5c"
  - Name: skill_active_detail_21
    Text: "Gi\u1EA3i ph\xF3ng m\u1ED9t l\xE0n s\xF3ng l\u1EEDa thi\xEAu \u0111\u1ED1t,
