  - Name: skill_active_name_22
    Text: "L\u1EDDi ch\xFAc ph\xFAc c\u1EE7a Sylvan"
  - Name: skill_active_detail_22
    Text: "Gi\u1EA3i ph\xF3ng ph\u01B0\u1EDBc l\xE0nh c\u1EE7a th\u1EA7n r\u1EEBng,
      g\xE2y s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng b\u1EB1ng {0}% ATK l\xEAn t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 k\u1EBB
      \u0111\u1ECBch v\xE0 h\u1ED3i m\xE1u b\u1EB1ng {1}% ATK cho t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3
      \u0111\u1ED3ng minh. Ban cho t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 \u0111\u1ED3ng minh hi\u1EC7u
      \u1EE9ng Verdant Grace trong {2} l\u01B0\u1EE3t. \r\nVerdant Grace: Khi m\u1ED9t
      t\u01B0\u1EDBng s\u1EDF h\u1EEFu Verdant Grace nh\u1EADn s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng
      ch\xED m\u1EA1ng, h\u1ECD s\u1EBD h\u1ED3i m\xE1u b\u1EB1ng {3}% ATK c\u1EE7a
      ng\u01B0\u1EDDi thi tri\u1EC3n. Hi\u1EC7u \u1EE9ng n\xE0y s\u1EBD m\u1EA5t
      hi\u1EC7u l\u1EF1c sau khi k\xEDch ho\u1EA1t nh\u01B0ng c\xF3 th\u1EC3 c\u1ED9ng
      d\u1ED3n."
  - Name: gear_skill_active_name_1
    Text: Steelstorm Requiem
  - Name: gear_skill_active_detail_1
