    Text: 1200 <sprite name="coin">
  - Name: package_Coin_3_name
    Text: "V\xE0ng 3"
  - Name: package_Coin_3_des
    Text: 2000 <sprite name="coin">
  - Name: starter_pack_title
    Text: "G\xF3i kh\u1EDFi \u0111\u1EA7u c\u1EE7a nh\xE0 th\xE1m hi\u1EC3m"
  - Name: starter_pack_des
    Text: "B\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u h\xE0nh tr\xECnh ho\xE0nh tr\xE1ng c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n
      v\u1EDBi kh\u1EDFi \u0111\u1EA7u ho\xE0n h\u1EA3o! G\xF3i Kh\u1EDFi \u0110\u1EA7u
      c\u1EE7a Nh\xE0 Th\xE1m Hi\u1EC3m ch\u1EE9a \u0111\u1EA7y \u0111\u1EE7 c\xE1c
      v\u1EADt ph\u1EA9m thi\u1EBFt y\u1EBFu \u0111\u1EC3 kh\u1EDFi \u0111\u1EA7u
      s\u1EF1 nghi\u1EC7p huy\u1EC1n tho\u1EA1i c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n. Ch\u1EC9 v\u1EDBi
      m\u1EE9c gi\xE1 th\u1EA5p, b\u1EA1n s\u1EBD nh\u1EADn \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c m\u1ECDi
      th\u1EE9 m\xE0 m\u1ED9t anh h\xF9ng m\u1EDBi c\u1EA7n."
  - Name: starter_pack_monster
    Text: "Nh\u1EADn m\u1ED9t \u0111\u1ED3ng minh qu\xE1i v\u1EADt mi\u1EC5n ph\xED"
  - Name: starter_pack_skin
    Text: "C\xE1c v\u1ECB th\u1EA7n chi\u1EBFn tranh c\u1EE7a b\u1ED9 l\u1EA1c"
  - Name: starter_pack
    Text: "G\xF3i kh\u1EDFi \u0111\u1EA7u"
  - Name: gear_0_name
    Text: Solarbrand
  - Name: gear_1_name
    Text: "Gi\xE1p Aegis Lumin"
  - Name: gear_2_name
    Text: "T\xF3c b\u1EDDm t\u1ECFa s\xE1ng"
  - Name: gear_3_name
    Text: Aegis of Dawn
  - Name: gear_4_name
    Text: "B\xF9a h\u1ED9 m\u1EC7nh Shardbond"
  - Name: gear_5_name
    Text: "Chi\u1EBFc nh\u1EABn c\u1EE7a Vitalis"
  - Name: gear_6_name
    Text: "C\xE1c trang c\u1EE7a Aeterna"
  - Name: gear_7_name
    Text: Bonecleaver
  - Name: gear_8_name
    Text: "Da c\u1EE7a k\u1EBB c\u01B0\u1EDBp b\xF3c"
  - Name: gear_9_name
    Text: "Kh\xF3a Tideborn"
  - Name: gear_10_name
    Text: "Huy hi\u1EC7u c\u1EE7a Veylor"
  - Name: gear_11_name
    Text: Verdant Crest
  - Name: gear_12_name
    Text: "D\u1EA3i Pyraxis"
  - Name: gear_13_name
    Text: "Cu\u1ED9n gi\u1EA5y Ngu\u1ED3n g\u1ED1c"
  - Name: gear_14_name
    Text: Gearfang Talon
  - Name: gear_15_name
    Text: MagTech Aegis
  - Name: gear_16_name
    Text: "V\u01B0\u01A1ng mi\u1EC7n Shockspire"
  - Name: gear_17_name
    Text: "Khi\xEAn Oakheart"
  - Name: gear_18_name
    Text: "Li\xEAn k\u1EBFt h\xE0o quang"
  - Name: gear_19_name
    Text: "Chi\u1EBFc nh\u1EABn c\u1EE7a Gravemire"
  - Name: gear_20_name
    Text: "Cu\u1ED9n gi\u1EA5y c\u1EE7a Viridias"
  - Name: gear_0_des
    Text: "Nh\u1EEFng s\u1EE3i v\xE0ng l\u1EA5p l\xE1nh \xE1nh s\xE1ng ban ph\u01B0\u1EDBc.
      Bi\u1EC3u t\u01B0\u1EE3ng cho \u0111\u1EE9c tin ki\xEAn \u0111\u1ECBnh v\xE0
      s\u1EF1 s\xE1ng su\u1ED1t c\u1EE7a hi\u1EC7p s\u0129 trong chi\u1EBFn tr\u1EADn."
  - Name: gear_1_des
    Text: "\u0110\u01B0\u1EE3c r\xE8n trong l\xF2ng m\u1ED9t ng\xF4i sao b\u0103ng,
      b\u1ED9 \u0111\u1ED3 n\xE0y truy\u1EC1n \xE1nh s\xE1ng thu\u1EA7n khi\u1EBFt
      v\xE0o m\u1ED9t r\xE0o c\u1EA3n g\u1EA7n nh\u01B0 kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 xuy\xEAn
      th\u1EE7ng."
  - Name: gear_2_des
    Text: "Nh\u1EEFng s\u1EE3i v\xE0ng l\u1EA5p l\xE1nh \xE1nh s\xE1ng ban ph\u01B0\u1EDBc.
      Bi\u1EC3u t\u01B0\u1EE3ng cho \u0111\u1EE9c tin ki\xEAn \u0111\u1ECBnh v\xE0
      s\u1EF1 s\xE1ng su\u1ED1t c\u1EE7a hi\u1EC7p s\u0129 trong chi\u1EBFn tr\u1EADn."
  - Name: gear_3_des
    Text: "Khi \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c nh\u1EEFng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi b\u1EA3o v\u1EC7 Li\xEAn
      minh mang theo, bi\u1EC3u t\u01B0\u1EE3ng v\xE0ng s\u1EBD t\u1ECFa s\xE1ng
      \u0111\u1EC3 truy\u1EC1n c\u1EA3m h\u1EE9ng can \u0111\u1EA3m v\xE0 c\u1EE7ng
      c\u1ED1 s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh cho \u0111\u1ED3ng minh."
  - Name: gear_4_des
    Text: "M\u1ED7i tinh th\u1EC3 \u0111\u1EC1u c\u1ED9ng h\u01B0\u1EDFng v\u1EDBi
      b\u1EA3n ch\u1EA5t c\u1EE7a Gaia, k\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i Scions v\xE0 nh\u1EEFng
      ng\u01B0\u1EDDi b\u1EA1n \u0111\u1ED3ng h\xE0nh c\u1EE7a h\u1ECD trong s\u1EE9c
      s\u1ED1ng chung v\xE0 s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh b\u1EC1n b\u1EC9."
  - Name: gear_5_des
    Text: "\u0110\u01B0\u1EE3c r\xE8n trong tr\xE1i tim c\u1EE7a Gaia, n\xF3 truy\u1EC1n
      n\u0103ng l\u01B0\u1EE3ng, t\u0103ng c\u01B0\u1EDDng t\u1ED1c \u0111\u1ED9
      cho ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111eo."
  - Name: gear_6_des
    Text: "\u0110\u01B0\u1EE3c ph\u1EE5c h\u1ED3i t\u1EEB t\xE0n t\xEDch Aeterna,
      nh\u1EEFng trang gi\u1EA5y n\xE0y l\u1EA5p l\xE1nh \xE1nh s\xE1ng Tinh t\xFA
      b\u1ECB l\xE3ng qu\xEAn, c\u1EE7ng c\u1ED1 s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh cho \u0111\u1ED9i
      qu\xE2n c\u1EE7a n\xF3."
  - Name: gear_7_des
    Text: "M\u1ED9t chi\u1EBFc r\xECu t\xE0n b\u1EA1o \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c r\xE8n
      t\u1EEB x\u01B0\u01A1ng, \u0111\xE1 v\xE0 ch\u1EEF rune c\u1EE7a b\u1ED9 l\u1EA1c.
      \u0110\u01B0\u1EE3c truy\u1EC1n l\u1EA1i qua c\xE1c th\u1EE7 l\u0129nh, n\xF3
      gi\xE1ng xu\u1ED1ng v\u1EDBi c\u01A1n th\u1ECBnh n\u1ED9 nguy\xEAn th\u1EE7y
      v\xE0 s\u1EF1 tr\u1EA3 th\xF9 kh\xF4ng ng\u1EEBng ngh\u1EC9."
  - Name: gear_8_des
    Text: "\u0110\u01B0\u1EE3c ch\u1EBF t\xE1c t\u1EEB da th\xFA v\xE0 gia c\u1ED1
      b\u1EB1ng kim lo\u1EA1i, b\u1ED9 gi\xE1p n\xE0y mang d\u1EA5u \u1EA5n c\u1EE7a
      h\xE0ng tr\u0103m tr\u1EADn chi\u1EBFn. \u0110\u01B0\u1EE3c c\xE1c v\u1ECB
      th\u1EA7n chi\u1EBFn tranh c\u1EE7a b\u1ED9 t\u1ED9c ban ph\u01B0\u1EDBc, n\xF3
      l\xE0 bi\u1EC3u t\u01B0\u1EE3ng c\u1EE7a t\u1ED9c tr\u01B0\u1EDFng."
  - Name: gear_9_des
    Text: "M\xE1i t\xF3c xanh bi\u1EBFc, \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c cho l\xE0 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      c\xE1c linh h\u1ED3n \u0111\u1EA1i d\u01B0\u01A1ng ban ph\u01B0\u1EDBc. Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
      ta tin r\u1EB1ng nh\u1EEFng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111eo n\xF3 s\u1EBD truy\u1EC1n
      t\u1EA3i s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh c\u1EE7a bi\u1EC3n c\u1EA3 v\xE0 \xFD ch\xED ki\xEAn
      \u0111\u1ECBnh."
  - Name: gear_10_des
    Text: "Mang d\u1EA5u \u1EA5n ho\xE0ng gia c\u1EE7a Veylor, m\u1ED9t ch\u1EE7ng
      t\u1ED9c t\u1EEBng chi\u1EBFn \u0111\u1EA5u b\xEAn c\u1EA1nh Scions nh\u01B0
      nh\u1EEFng \u0111\u1ED3ng minh, chi\u1EBFc khi\xEAn n\xE0y mang theo di s\u1EA3n
      v\u1EC1 danh d\u1EF1 v\xE0 s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh c\u1EE7a h\u1ECD."
  - Name: gear_11_des
    Text: "\u0110\u01B0\u1EE3c r\xE8n b\u1EB1ng tinh ch\u1EA5t ng\u1ECDc l\u1EE5c
      b\u1EA3o, n\xF3 t\xF4n vinh nh\u1EEFng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\xE3 b\u1EA3o
      v\u1EC7 Gaia trong th\u1EDDi kh\u1EAFc b\xE0 c\u1EA7n \u0111\u1EBFn."
  - Name: gear_12_des
    Text: "\u0110\u01B0\u1EE3c ch\u1EBF t\xE1c trong l\xF2 r\xE8n n\xFAi l\u1EEDa,
      chi\u1EBFc nh\u1EABn n\xE0y truy\u1EC1n t\u1EA3i d\xF2ng m\xE1u r\u1EF1c l\u1EEDa
      c\u1EE7a Pyraxis \u0111\u1EC3 ti\u1EBFp th\xEAm s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh cho ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
      \u0111eo."
  - Name: gear_13_des
    Text: "M\u1ED9t v\u0103n t\u1EF1 c\u1ED5 x\u01B0a ghi l\u1EA1i h\u01A1i th\u1EDF
      \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn c\u1EE7a Gaia. Nh\u1EEFng l\u1EDDi v\u0103n trong \u0111\xF3
      c\u1EE7ng c\u1ED1 t\xE2m h\u1ED3n v\xE0 b\u1EA3o v\u1EC7 c\u01A1 th\u1EC3."
  - Name: gear_14_des
    Text: "M\u1ED9t chi\u1EBFc vu\u1ED1t cong c\u01A1 kh\xED \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      gia c\u1ED1 b\u1EB1ng l\u01B0\u1EE1i dao th\xEDch \u1EE9ng. N\xF3 c\u1EAFt
      v\u1EDBi \u0111\u1ED9 ch\xEDnh x\xE1c c\u1EE7a dao m\u1ED5 v\xE0 s\u1EF1 hung
      d\u1EEF c\u1EE7a m\u1ED9t con th\xFA."
  - Name: gear_15_des
    Text: "\u0110\u01B0\u1EE3c r\xE8n t\u1EEB h\u1EE3p kim gia c\u1ED1 v\xE0 cung
      c\u1EA5p n\u0103ng l\u01B0\u1EE3ng b\u1EDFi l\xF5i n\u0103ng l\u01B0\u1EE3ng,
      b\u1ED9 gi\xE1p \u0111\u1ECF th\u1EABm n\xE0y k\u1EBFt h\u1EE3p s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh
      th\xF4 s\u01A1 v\u1EDBi k\u1EF9 thu\u1EADt ch\xEDnh x\xE1c."
  - Name: gear_16_des
    Text: "M\xE1i t\xF3c b\u1EA1c tr\u1EAFng hoang d\xE3 v\u1EDBi n\u0103ng l\u01B0\u1EE3ng
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u1ED3n \u0111\u1EA1i s\u1EBD b\xF9ng n\u1ED5 khi
      tr\u1EADn chi\u1EBFn s\u1EAFp \u0111\u1EBFn g\u1EA7n. D\u1EA5u hi\u1EC7u c\u1EE7a
      c\xE1c hi\u1EC7p s\u0129 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c k\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i v\u1EDBi l\xF5i
      n\u0103ng l\u01B0\u1EE3ng."
  - Name: gear_17_des
    Text: "Mang d\u1EA5u \u1EA5n c\u1EE7a c\xE2y c\u1ED5 th\u1EE5 Whisperwood, n\xF3
      b\u1EA3o v\u1EC7 \u0111\u1ED3ng minh b\u1EB1ng s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh b\u1EC1n
      b\u1EC9 c\u1EE7a c\xE1c linh h\u1ED3n nguy\xEAn t\u1ED1."
  - Name: gear_18_des
    Text: "Nh\u1EEFng vi\xEAn ng\u1ECDc v\xE0ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c li\xEAn k\u1EBFt
      v\u1EDBi nhau t\u1EA1o th\xE0nh m\u1ED9t giao \u01B0\u1EDBc th\u1ED1ng nh\u1EA5t,
      mang l\u1EA1i s\u1EE9c b\u1EC1n cho nh\u1EEFng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi c\xF9ng chi\u1EBFn
      \u0111\u1EA5u."
  - Name: gear_19_des
    Text: "\u0110\u01B0\u1EE3c r\xE8n t\u1EA1i Sanctum Viridias \u0111\xE3 m\u1EA5t,
      chi\u1EBFc nh\u1EABn kh\u1EAFc h\xECnh con r\u1EAFn n\xE0y hi\u1EC7n mang theo
      di s\u1EA3n \u0111\xE3 m\u1EA5t c\u1EE7a m\u1ED9t Sentinel."
  - Name: gear_20_des
    Text: "\u0110\u01B0\u1EE3c ph\u1EE5c h\u1ED3i t\u1EEB Sanctum Viridias tr\u01B0\u1EDBc
      khi n\u01A1i n\xE0y s\u1EE5p \u0111\u1ED5, t\u1EADp l\u1EC7nh n\xE0y truy\u1EC1n
      t\u1EA3i tr\xED tu\u1EC7 c\u1EE7a Sentinel v\xE0o c\xE1c l\xE1 b\xF9a b\u1EA3o
      v\u1EC7."
  - Name: gear_sub_upgrade
    Text: "**N\xE2ng c\u1EA5p trang b\u1ECB c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n \u0111\u1EC3 t\u0103ng
      s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh cho anh h\xF9ng c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n**"
  - Name: gear_sub_max_level
    Text: "**C\u1EA5p \u0111\u1ED9 trang b\u1ECB kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 v\u01B0\u1EE3t
      qu\xE1 c\u1EA5p \u0111\u1ED9 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i**"
