  - Name: portal_des
    Text: "T\u1EA1i v\xF9ng \u0111\u1EA5t c\u1ED5 x\u01B0a {0}, m\u1ED9t khe n\u1EE9t
      thi\xEAn th\u1EC3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c g\u1ECDi l\xE0 C\u1ED5ng Tinh T\xFA th\u1EE9c
      t\u1EC9nh - m\u1ED9t c\xE1nh c\u1ED5ng n\u1ED1i li\u1EC1n c\xE1c c\xF5i gi\u1EDBi,
      n\u01A1i th\u1EDDi gian c\u0169ng run r\u1EA9y. Sinh ra t\u1EEB nh\u1EEFng
      ch\xF2m sao b\u1ECB l\xE3ng qu\xEAn v\xE0 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c phong \u1EA5n
      b\u1EDFi nh\u1EEFng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi b\u1EA3o v\u1EC7 c\u1ED5 x\u01B0a, n\xF3
      ng\xE2n nga nh\u1EEFng \xE2m thanh v\u1ECDng l\u1EA1i t\u1EEB v\xF4 v\xE0n
      th\u1EBF gi\u1EDBi \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECB l\xE3ng qu\xEAn t\u1EEB l\xE2u trong
      l\u1ECBch s\u1EED. Khi C\u1ED5ng m\u1EDF ra, b\u1EA7u tr\u1EDDi r\u1EF1c s\xE1ng,
      v\xE0 t\u1EEB b\xEAn trong xu\u1EA5t hi\u1EC7n Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi Gi\u1EEF C\u1ED5ng
      - m\u1ED9t th\u1EF1c th\u1EC3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c t\u1EA1o n\xEAn t\u1EEB \xE1nh
      sao v\xE0 b\xF3ng t\u1ED1i, mang s\u1EE9 m\u1EC7nh th\u1EED th\xE1ch l\xF2ng
      d\u0169ng c\u1EA3m c\u1EE7a b\u1EA5t c\u1EE9 ai d\xE1m \u0111\u1EBFn g\u1EA7n.
      M\u1ED7i \u0111\xF2n t\u1EA5n c\xF4ng v\xE0o n\xF3 \u0111\u1EC1u vang v\u1ECDng
      kh\u1EAFp h\u01B0 kh\xF4ng, m\u1ED9t th\u1EED th\xE1ch kh\xF4ng ch\u1EC9 v\u1EC1
      s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh, m\xE0 c\xF2n v\u1EC1 quy\u1EBFt t\xE2m."
  - Name: portal_unknow_local
    Text: Myrk
  - Name: portal_guide
    Text: "M\u1ED9t c\xE1nh c\u1ED5ng b\xED \u1EA9n k\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i hai th\u1EBF
      gi\u1EDBi. B\xEAn trong \u0111ang ch\u1EDD \u0111\u1EE3i Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi Gi\u1EEF
      C\u1ED5ng - m\u1ED9t ng\u01B0\u1EDDi b\u1EA3o v\u1EC7 h\xF9ng m\u1EA1nh \u0111ang
      \u0111e d\u1ECDa v\u01B0\u01A1ng qu\u1ED1c c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n. Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
      Gi\u1EEF C\u1ED5ng c\xE0ng m\u1EA1nh, th\u1EED th\xE1ch c\xE0ng l\u1EDBn\u2026
      v\xE0 ph\u1EA7n th\u01B0\u1EDFng c\xE0ng l\u1EDBn.\r\n<size=70%><size=70%><sprite
      name=\"icon_portal_brown\"></size> </size>\u0110\u1EC3 v\xE0o, b\u1EA1n ph\u1EA3i
      s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng <b>Ch\xECa Kh\xF3a C\u1ED5ng Tinh T\xFA</b>. <b>3 Ch\xECa
      Kh\xF3a C\u1ED5ng Tinh T\xFA</b> \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ph\u1EE5c h\u1ED3i m\u1ED7i
      ng\xE0y v\xE0o l\xFAc <b>00:00 (GMT+0)</b>. Ch\xECa kh\xF3a ch\u01B0a s\u1EED
      d\u1EE5ng <b>kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c chuy\u1EC3n sang</b> ng\xE0y
      h\xF4m sau.\r\n<size=70%><sprite name=\"icon_portal_brown\"></size> Sau khi
      m\u1EDF, c\u1ED5ng <b>s\u1EBD t\u1ED3n t\u1EA1i trong 24 gi\u1EDD</b>.\r\n<size=70%><sprite
      name=\"icon_portal_brown\"></size> M\u1ED7i l\u1EA7n th\u1EED th\xE1ch <b>s\u1EBD
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ph\u1EE5c h\u1ED3i sau m\u1ED7i gi\u1EDD</b>, v\u1EDBi
      <b>t\u1ED1i \u0111a 20 l\u1EA7n th\u1EED</b> \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c l\u01B0u tr\u1EEF.\r\n<size=70%><sprite
      name=\"icon_portal_brown\"></size> C\u1ED5ng c\xF3 th\u1EC3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      <b>m\u1EDF l\u1EA1i sau 1 gi\u1EDD</b> sau khi \u0111\xF3ng.\r\n<size=70%><sprite
      name=\"icon_portal_brown\"></size> <b>Ph\u1EA7n th\u01B0\u1EDFng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      g\u1EEDi qua th\u01B0</b> sau khi Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi gi\u1EEF c\u1ED5ng b\u1ECB
      \u0111\xE1nh b\u1EA1i.\r\n<size=70%><sprite name=\"icon_portal_brown\"></size>
      <b>Th\u1EE9 h\u1EA1ng tr\u1EADn chi\u1EBFn quy\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ECBnh kho b\xE1u
      cu\u1ED1i c\xF9ng c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n</b> - ch\u1EC9 nh\u1EEFng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
      ki\xEAn tr\xEC nh\u1EA5t s\u1EBD v\u01B0\u01A1n l\xEAn \u0111\u1EC9nh cao tr\u01B0\u1EDBc
      khi c\xE1nh c\u1ED5ng bi\u1EBFn m\u1EA5t."
