    Text: "Ph\u1EA7n th\u01B0\u1EDFng Tr\xF9m Gia T\u1ED9c"
  - Name: miss_clan_boss_reward
    Text: "\u0110\xE2y l\xE0 ph\u1EA7n th\u01B0\u1EDFng t\u1EEB tr\u1EADn \u0111\u1EA5u
      Tr\xF9m Bang H\u1ED9i h\xF4m qua. L\xF2ng d\u0169ng c\u1EA3m c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n
      vang v\u1ECDng kh\u1EAFp h\xE0nh lang, v\xE0 Bang H\u1ED9i tr\u1EDF n\xEAn
      m\u1EA1nh m\u1EBD h\u01A1n nh\u1EDD c\xF3 b\u1EA1n."
