  - Name: card_player_must_level_up
    Text: "B\u1EA1n ph\u1EA3i l\xEAn c\u1EA5p tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi n\xE2ng c\u1EA5p
      qu\xE1i v\u1EADt!"
  - Name: card_player_level_max
    Text: "Qu\xE1i v\u1EADt \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1EA1t \u0111\u1EBFn c\u1EA5p \u0111\u1ED9
      t\u1ED1i \u0111a!"
