    Text: "Kh\xF4ng t\xECm th\u1EA5y d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u h\u1EC7 th\u1ED1ng."
  - Name: SERVER_NOT_FOUND
    Text: "M\xE1y ch\u1EE7 \u0111\xE3 \u0111\xF3ng."
  - Name: USERDATA_NOT_FOUND_USER
    Text: "Kh\xF4ng t\xECm th\u1EA5y d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\xF9ng."
  - Name: USERDATA_NOT_ENOUGH_ITEM
    Text: "D\u1EEF li\u1EC7u ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\xF9ng kh\xF4ng \u0111\u1EE7 m\u1EE5c."
  - Name: USERDATA_SAME_OLD_NAME
    Text: "D\u1EEF li\u1EC7u ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\xF9ng v\u1EABn gi\u1EEF nguy\xEAn
      t\xEAn c\u0169."
  - Name: USERDATA_NOT_CHANGE
    Text: "D\u1EEF li\u1EC7u ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\xF9ng kh\xF4ng thay \u0111\u1ED5i."
  - Name: USERPROFILE_NOT_FOUND_AVATAR
    Text: "Kh\xF4ng t\xECm th\u1EA5y \u1EA3nh \u0111\u1EA1i di\u1EC7n c\u1EE7a ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
      d\xF9ng."
  - Name: USERPROFILE_NOT_FOUND_AVATAR_BORDER
    Text: "Kh\xF4ng t\xECm th\u1EA5y \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng vi\u1EC1n \u1EA3nh \u0111\u1EA1i
      di\u1EC7n c\u1EE7a h\u1ED3 s\u01A1 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\xF9ng."
  - Name: USERPROFILE_AVATAR_ALREADY_OWN
    Text: "\u1EA2nh \u0111\u1EA1i di\u1EC7n c\u1EE7a ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\xF9ng \u0111\xE3
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c s\u1EDF h\u1EEFu."
  - Name: USERPROFILE_AVATAR_BORDER_ALREADY_OWN
    Text: "\u0110\u01B0\u1EDDng vi\u1EC1n \u1EA3nh \u0111\u1EA1i di\u1EC7n c\u1EE7a
      ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\xF9ng \u0111\xE3 s\u1EDF h\u1EEFu."
  - Name: ACCOUNT_WRONG_USERNAME_OR_PASSWORD
    Text: "T\xEAn ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\xF9ng ho\u1EB7c m\u1EADt kh\u1EA9u kh\xF4ng \u0111\xFAng.
      Vui l\xF2ng th\u1EED l\u1EA1i."
  - Name: ACCOUNT_ALREADY_EXISTS
    Text: "T\xE0i kho\u1EA3n \u0111\xE3 t\u1ED3n t\u1EA1i."
  - Name: ACCOUNT_NOT_FOUND
    Text: "Kh\xF4ng t\xECm th\u1EA5y t\xE0i kho\u1EA3n."
  - Name: ACCOUNT_GOOGLE_LINKED
    Text: "T\xE0i kho\u1EA3n \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c li\xEAn k\u1EBFt v\u1EDBi
      Google."
  - Name: ACCOUNT_GOOGLE_LINKED_BY_OTHER_ACCOUNT
    Text: "T\xE0i kho\u1EA3n Google \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c li\xEAn k\u1EBFt b\u1EDFi
      t\xE0i kho\u1EA3n kh\xE1c."
  - Name: ACCOUNT_DELETED
    Text: "T\xE0i kho\u1EA3n \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECB x\xF3a."
  - Name: ACCOUNT_BANNED
    Text: "T\xE0i kho\u1EA3n \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECB c\u1EA5m."
  - Name: ACCOUNT_GOOGLE_PLAY_LINKED
    Text: "T\xE0i kho\u1EA3n \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c li\xEAn k\u1EBFt v\u1EDBi
      Google Play."
  - Name: ACCOUNT_GOOGLE_PLAY_LINKED_BY_OTHER_ACCOUNT
    Text: "T\xE0i kho\u1EA3n \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c li\xEAn k\u1EBFt v\u1EDBi
      Google Play b\u1EB1ng t\xE0i kho\u1EA3n kh\xE1c."
  - Name: CHARACTER_NOT_FOUND
    Text: "Kh\xF4ng t\xECm th\u1EA5y k\xFD t\u1EF1."
  - Name: GEAR_NOT_FOUND
    Text: "Kh\xF4ng t\xECm th\u1EA5y thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB."
  - Name: GEAR_CAP_LEVEL
    Text: "M\u1EE9c n\u1EAFp h\u1ED9p s\u1ED1."
  - Name: CLAN_USER_ALREADY_IN_CLAN
    Text: "Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i kh\xF4ng thu\u1ED9c bang h\u1ED9i c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n."
  - Name: CLAN_NOT_FOUND
    Text: "Kh\xF4ng t\xECm th\u1EA5y gia t\u1ED9c."
  - Name: CLAN_MAX_MEMBER
    Text: "Gia t\u1ED9c \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1EA1t \u0111\u1EBFn s\u1ED1 l\u01B0\u1EE3ng
      th\xE0nh vi\xEAn t\u1ED1i \u0111a!"
  - Name: CLAN_USER_NOT_JOIN_CLAN
    Text: "Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\xF9ng clan kh\xF4ng tham gia clan."
  - Name: CLAN_LEADER_CANNOT_LEAVE
    Text: "Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\u1EE9ng \u0111\u1EA7u gia t\u1ED9c kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3
      r\u1EDDi \u0111i."
  - Name: CLAN_WAS_DELETED
    Text: "Gia t\u1ED9c \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECB x\xF3a."
  - Name: CLAN_CANNOT_REMOVE_LEADER
    Text: "B\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 x\xF3a b\u1ECF Tr\u01B0\u1EDFng t\u1ED9c."
  - Name: CLAN_CANNOT_PROMOTE_YOURSELF
    Text: "Gia t\u1ED9c kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 t\u1EF1 qu\u1EA3ng b\xE1 cho m\xECnh."
  - Name: CLAN_CANNOT_PROMOTE_LEADER
    Text: "Gia t\u1ED9c kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 th\u0103ng ch\u1EE9c cho th\u1EE7 l\u0129nh."
  - Name: CLAN_MAX_DEPUTY
    Text: "Gia t\u1ED9c \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1EA1t \u0111\u1EBFn s\u1ED1 l\u01B0\u1EE3ng
      \u0110\u1ED3ng th\u1EE7 l\u0129nh t\u1ED1i \u0111a!"
  - Name: CLAN_MAX_CAPTAIN
    Text: "Gia t\u1ED9c \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1EA1t \u0111\u1EBFn s\u1ED1 l\u01B0\u1EE3ng
      thuy\u1EC1n tr\u01B0\u1EDFng t\u1ED1i \u0111a!"
  - Name: CLAN_CANNOT_PROMOTE_HIGER_ROLE
    Text: "Gia t\u1ED9c kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 th\u0103ng ch\u1EE9c l\xEAn vai tr\xF2
      cao h\u01A1n."
  - Name: CLAN_JUST_LEADER_CAN_DELETE
    Text: "Ch\u1EC9 c\xF3 th\u1EE7 l\u0129nh c\u1EE7a gia t\u1ED9c m\u1EDBi c\xF3
      th\u1EC3 x\xF3a."
  - Name: CLAN_JUST_LEADER_CAN_EDIT
    Text: "Ch\u1EC9 c\xF3 th\u1EE7 l\u0129nh gia t\u1ED9c m\u1EDBi c\xF3 th\u1EC3
      ch\u1EC9nh s\u1EEDa."
  - Name: CLAN_DONATE_NOT_FOUND
    Text: "Kh\xF4ng t\xECm th\u1EA5y quy\xEAn g\xF3p cho gia t\u1ED9c."
  - Name: CLAN_DONATE_AMOUNT_MAX
    Text: "S\u1ED1 ti\u1EC1n quy\xEAn g\xF3p t\u1ED1i \u0111a c\u1EE7a gia t\u1ED9c."
  - Name: CLAN_BOSS_MAX_TIME_ATTACK
    Text: "B\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1EA1t \u0111\u1EBFn s\u1ED1 l\u1EA7n t\u1EA5n
      c\xF4ng t\u1ED1i \u0111a, vui l\xF2ng \u0111\u1EE3i \u0111\u1EBFn ng\xE0y h\xF4m
      sau."
  - Name: CLAN_JUST_LEADER_CAN_CHANGE_LEADER
    Text: "B\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i l\xE0 th\u1EE7 l\u0129nh c\u1EE7a gia t\u1ED9c."
  - Name: CLAN_JOIN_COOLDOWN
    Text: "B\u1EA1n ph\u1EA3i \u0111\u1EE3i 24 gi\u1EDD tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi tham
      gia m\u1ED9t gia t\u1ED9c m\u1EDBi."
  - Name: FRIEND_SEND_REQUEST_FAILED
    Text: "Y\xEAu c\u1EA7u g\u1EEDi b\u1EA1n b\xE8 kh\xF4ng th\xE0nh c\xF4ng."
  - Name: FRIEND_ALREADY_REQUEST
    Text: "B\u1EA1n b\xE8 \u0111\xE3 y\xEAu c\u1EA7u."
  - Name: FRIEND_ALREADY_FRIEND
    Text: "B\u1EA1n b\xE8 r\u1ED3i l\u1EA1i l\xE0 b\u1EA1n b\xE8."
  - Name: FRIEND_NOT_FOUND
    Text: "Kh\xF4ng t\xECm th\u1EA5y b\u1EA1n b\xE8."
  - Name: FRIEND_YOU_REACH_CAP
    Text: "B\u1EA1n \u01A1i, b\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1EA1t \u0111\u1EBFn gi\u1EDBi
      h\u1EA1n r\u1ED3i."
  - Name: FRIEND_PARTNER_REACH_CAP
    Text: "B\u1EA1n b\xE8 \u0111\u1ED1i t\xE1c \u0111\u1EA1t t\u1EDBi gi\u1EDBi h\u1EA1n."
  - Name: SHOPDAILY_NOT_FOUND
    Text: "Kh\xF4ng t\xECm th\u1EA5y c\u1EEDa h\xE0ng h\xE0ng ng\xE0y."
  - Name: SHOPDAILY_INVALID_INDEX
    Text: "Ch\u1EC9 s\u1ED1 kh\xF4ng h\u1EE3p l\u1EC7 c\u1EE7a c\u1EEDa h\xE0ng h\xE0ng
      ng\xE0y."
  - Name: SHOPDAILY_ALREADY_BUY
    Text: "Mua s\u1EAFm h\xE0ng ng\xE0y \u0111\xE3 mua."
  - Name: SHOP_INVALID_INDEX
    Text: "Ch\u1EC9 m\u1EE5c c\u1EEDa h\xE0ng kh\xF4ng h\u1EE3p l\u1EC7."
  - Name: SHOP_INVALID_PRODUCT_ID
    Text: "M\xE3 s\u1EA3n ph\u1EA9m mua h\xE0ng kh\xF4ng h\u1EE3p l\u1EC7."
  - Name: ITEM_NOT_FOUND
    Text: "Kh\xF4ng t\xECm th\u1EA5y m\u1EE5c n\xE0o."
  - Name: ITEM_CANNOT_USE
    Text: "Kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng s\u1EA3n ph\u1EA9m."
  - Name: ITEM_CANNOT_SELL
    Text: "Kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 b\xE1n \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c m\u1EB7t h\xE0ng."
  - Name: ITEM_CANNOT_COMBINE
    Text: "V\u1EADt ph\u1EA9m kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 k\u1EBFt h\u1EE3p."
  - Name: ITEM_CANNOT_MERGE
    Text: "M\u1EE5c kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 h\u1EE3p nh\u1EA5t."
  - Name: ITEM_CANNOT_EXCHANGE
    Text: "Kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 \u0111\u1ED5i s\u1EA3n ph\u1EA9m."
  - Name: PLAYER_MAIL_NOT_FOUND
    Text: "Kh\xF4ng t\xECm th\u1EA5y th\u01B0 c\u1EE7a ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i."
  - Name: DAILY_QUEST_NOT_FOUND
    Text: "Kh\xF4ng t\xECm th\u1EA5y nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EE5 h\xE0ng ng\xE0y."
  - Name: DAILY_QUEST_ALREADY_REWARD
    Text: "Nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EE5 h\xE0ng ng\xE0y \u0111\xE3 c\xF3 ph\u1EA7n th\u01B0\u1EDFng."
  - Name: DAILY_QUEST_DATA_NOT_FOUND
    Text: "Kh\xF4ng t\xECm th\u1EA5y d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EE5 h\xE0ng
      ng\xE0y."
  - Name: DAILY_QUEST_NOT_DONE
    Text: "Nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EE5 h\xE0ng ng\xE0y ch\u01B0a ho\xE0n th\xE0nh."
  - Name: ACHIEVEMENT_NOT_FOUND
    Text: "Kh\xF4ng t\xECm th\u1EA5y th\xE0nh t\xEDch."
  - Name: ACHIEVEMENT_CAP
    Text: "Gi\u1EDBi h\u1EA1n th\xE0nh t\xEDch."
  - Name: ACHIEVEMENT_NOT_REACH_LV
    Text: "Th\xE0nh t\xEDch ch\u01B0a \u0111\u1EA1t \u0111\u1EBFn c\u1EA5p \u0111\u1ED9."
  - Name: CARD_NOT_FOUND
    Text: "Kh\xF4ng t\xECm th\u1EA5y th\u1EBB."
  - Name: CARD_CAP_UPSTAR
    Text: "M\u0169 th\u1EBB upstar."
  - Name: CARD_NOT_FOUND_STAR_DATA
    Text: "Kh\xF4ng t\xECm th\u1EA5y d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u th\u1EBB sao."
  - Name: CARD_NOT_FOUND_DATA
    Text: "Kh\xF4ng t\xECm th\u1EA5y d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u th\u1EBB."
  - Name: CARD_SUMMON_DATA_NOT_FOUND
    Text: "Kh\xF4ng t\xECm th\u1EA5y d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i th\u1EBB."
  - Name: CARD_SUMMON_DATA_NOT_FOUND_LIST_INDEX
    Text: "Kh\xF4ng t\xECm th\u1EA5y danh s\xE1ch ch\u1EC9 m\u1EE5c d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u
      tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i th\u1EBB."
  - Name: PLAYER_LAND_ALREADY_CHOSEN
    Text: "Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i \u0111\xE3 ch\u1ECDn v\xF9ng \u0111\u1EA5t."
  - Name: PACKAGE_IAP_NOT_FOUND
    Text: "Kh\xF4ng t\xECm th\u1EA5y g\xF3i iap."
  - Name: IAP_INVALID_TRANSACTION
    Text: "\u0110\xE3 ph\xE1t hi\u1EC7n m\xE3 th\xF4ng b\xE1o mua h\xE0ng kh\xF4ng
      h\u1EE3p l\u1EC7 ho\u1EB7c \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng l\u1EA1i."
  - Name: CHEST_NOT_FOUND
    Text: "Kh\xF4ng t\xECm th\u1EA5y r\u01B0\u01A1ng."
  - Name: CHEST_SLOT_NOT_FOUND
    Text: "Kh\xF4ng t\xECm th\u1EA5y \xF4 r\u01B0\u01A1ng."
  - Name: CHEST_SLOT_DO_NOT_ENOUGH_LEVEL_UNLOCK
    Text: "C\u1EA5p \u0111\u1ED9 c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n ch\u01B0a \u0111\u1EE7 cao \u0111\u1EC3
      m\u1EDF kh\xF3a \xF4 n\xE0y."
  - Name: CHEST_SLOT_ALREADY_UNLOCKING
    Text: "Khe r\u01B0\u01A1ng n\xE0y \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c m\u1EDF kh\xF3a."
  - Name: CHEST_SLOT_NOT_UNLOCK
    Text: "Khe r\u01B0\u01A1ng n\xE0y v\u1EABn ch\u01B0a \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c m\u1EDF
      kh\xF3a."
  - Name: DAILY_REWARD_RECIEVED
    Text: "B\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 nh\u1EADn \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ph\u1EA7n th\u01B0\u1EDFng
      h\xE0ng ng\xE0y."
  - Name: DAILY_REWARD_NOT_FOUND_DATA
    Text: "Kh\xF4ng t\xECm th\u1EA5y d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u ph\u1EA7n th\u01B0\u1EDFng
      h\xE0ng ng\xE0y."
  - Name: DAILY_REWARD_NOT_FOUND_VERSION
    Text: "Kh\xF4ng t\xECm th\u1EA5y phi\xEAn b\u1EA3n ph\u1EA7n th\u01B0\u1EDFng
      h\xE0ng ng\xE0y."
  - Name: OUTPOST_ALREADY_OCCUPIED
    Text: "Ph\xE1o \u0111\xE0i \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECB chi\u1EBFm \u0111\xF3ng."
  - Name: PORTAL_BOSS_ALREADY_UNLOCK
    Text: "C\u1ED5ng Astral \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c m\u1EDF kh\xF3a."
  - Name: PORTAL_BOSS_LOCK
    Text: "Tr\xF9m Astral Gate \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECB kh\xF3a."
  - Name: PORTAL_BOSS_ATTACK_TIME_END
    Text: "Th\u1EDDi gian t\u1EA5n c\xF4ng tr\xF9m Astral Gate \u0111\xE3 k\u1EBFt
      th\xFAc."
  - Name: PORTAL_BOSS_COOLDOWN
    Text: "Tr\xF9m Astral Gate \u0111ang trong th\u1EDDi gian h\u1ED3i chi\xEAu."
  - Name: PORTAL_BOSS_COOLDOWN_ATTACK_TIME
    Text: "Kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ph\xE9p t\u1EA5n c\xF4ng trong th\u1EDDi
      gian h\u1ED3i chi\xEAu."
  - Name: PORTAL_BOSS_DEAD
    Text: "Tr\xF9m Astral Gate \u0111\xE3 ch\u1EBFt."
  - Name: PORTAL_BOSS_NOT_ENOUGH_ATTACK
    Text: "B\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1EA1t \u0111\u1EBFn s\u1ED1 l\u1EA7n t\u1EA5n
      c\xF4ng t\u1ED1i \u0111a, vui l\xF2ng \u0111\u1EE3i \u0111\u1EBFn ng\xE0y h\xF4m
      sau."
  - Name: ARENA_OPPONENT_NOT_FOUND
    Text: "Kh\xF4ng t\xECm th\u1EA5y \u0111\u1ED1i th\u1EE7 trong \u0111\u1EA5u tr\u01B0\u1EDDng."
  - Name: ARENA_OPPONENT_ALREADY_WIN
    Text: "\u0110\u1ED1i th\u1EE7 tr\xEAn \u0111\u1EA5u tr\u01B0\u1EDDng \u0111\xE3
      th\u1EAFng."
  - Name: exchange_item_ask
    Text: "B\u1EA1n c\xF3 s\u1EB5n l\xF2ng trao \u0111\u1ED5i {0} v\u1EDBi s\u1ED1
      ph\u1EADn \u0111\u1EC3 l\u1EA5y {1} kh\xF4ng?"
  - Name: exchange_item
    Text: "Trao \u0111\u1ED5i"
  - Name: quit
    Text: "Tho\xE1t"
  - Name: quit_ask
    Text: "B\u1EA1n c\xF3 ch\u1EAFc ch\u1EAFn mu\u1ED1n tho\xE1t kh\u1ECFi tr\xF2
      ch\u01A1i kh\xF4ng?"
  - Name: logout
    Text: "\u0110\u0103ng xu\u1EA5t"
  - Name: logout_ask
    Text: "B\u1EA1n c\xF3 ch\u1EAFc ch\u1EAFn mu\u1ED1n \u0110\u0103ng xu\u1EA5t
      kh\xF4ng?"
  - Name: evolve_card
    Text: "Ti\u1EBFn h\xF3a"
  - Name: purchase_success
    Text: "Mua h\xE0ng th\xE0nh c\xF4ng"
  - Name: buy_success
    Text: "Mua th\xE0nh c\xF4ng"
  - Name: name_too_long
    Text: "T\xEAn ph\u1EA3i \xEDt h\u01A1n 10 k\xFD t\u1EF1!"
  - Name: name_too_short
    Text: "T\xEAn ph\u1EA3i c\xF3 \xEDt nh\u1EA5t 3 k\xFD t\u1EF1!"
  - Name: username_too_short
    Text: "T\xEAn ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\xF9ng ph\u1EA3i c\xF3 \xEDt nh\u1EA5t 6 k\xFD
      t\u1EF1!"
  - Name: password_too_short
    Text: "M\u1EADt kh\u1EA9u ph\u1EA3i c\xF3 \xEDt nh\u1EA5t 6 k\xFD t\u1EF1"
  - Name: level_5_to_skip_battle
    Text: "T\xEDnh n\u0103ng b\u1ECF qua tr\u1EADn chi\u1EBFn \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      m\u1EDF kh\xF3a \u1EDF c\u1EA5p \u0111\u1ED9 5. H\xE3y ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c ti\u1EBFn
      tri\u1EC3n!"
  - Name: daily_reward
    Text: "Ph\u1EA7n th\u01B0\u1EDFng h\xE0ng ng\xE0y"
  - Name: daily_reward_title
    Text: "\u0110\u0103ng nh\u1EADp h\xE0ng ng\xE0y"
  - Name: daily_reward_des
    Text: "\u0110\u1EEBng b\u1ECF l\u1EE1! \u0110\u0103ng nh\u1EADp m\u1ED7i ng\xE0y
      \u0111\u1EC3 nh\u1EADn ph\u1EA7n th\u01B0\u1EDFng h\u1EA5p d\u1EABn v\xE0 t\u0103ng
      s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh cho h\xE0nh tr\xECnh trong tr\xF2 ch\u01A1i c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n!"
  - Name: daily_reward_countdown
    Text: "Y\xEAu c\u1EA7u trong:\r\n"
  - Name: daily_reward_reset
    Text: "\u0110\u1EB7t l\u1EA1i trong:\r\n"
  - Name: chat_no_clan
    Text: "B\u1EA1n ph\u1EA3i \u1EDF trong m\u1ED9t gia t\u1ED9c m\u1EDBi c\xF3 th\u1EC3
      tr\xF2 chuy\u1EC7n v\u1EDBi th\xE0nh vi\xEAn trong gia t\u1ED9c."
  - Name: reset_in
    Text: "\u0110\u1EB7t l\u1EA1i trong:"
  - Name: portal_rank_empty
    Text: "Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi g\xE1c c\u1ED5ng \u0111ang ch\u1EDD \u0111\u1EE3i. Kh\xF4ng
      c\xF3 k\u1EBB th\xE1ch th\u1EE9c n\xE0o \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c x\u1EBFp h\u1EA1ng."
  - Name: addressable_load_fail_title
    Text: "T\u1EA3i xu\u1ED1ng kh\xF4ng th\xE0nh c\xF4ng"
  - Name: addressable_load_fail_message
    Text: "T\u1EA3i xu\u1ED1ng t\xE0i nguy\xEAn kh\xF4ng th\xE0nh c\xF4ng. H\xE3y
      ki\u1EC3m tra k\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i v\xE0 th\u1EED t\u1EA3i l\u1EA1i."
  - Name: DuplicateDevice
    Text: "T\xE0i kho\u1EA3n c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n \u0111ang \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u0103ng
      nh\u1EADp tr\xEAn m\u1ED9t thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB kh\xE1c."
  - Name: gps_disabled
    Text: "GPS b\u1ECB v\xF4 hi\u1EC7u h\xF3a"
  - Name: gps_not_found
    Text: "Kh\xF4ng t\xECm th\u1EA5y t\xEDn hi\u1EC7u GPS"
  - Name: waiting_for_gps_signal
    Text: "\u0110ang ch\u1EDD t\xEDn hi\u1EC7u GPS"
  - Name: connect_unstable
    Text: "K\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i kh\xF4ng \u1ED5n \u0111\u1ECBnh"
  - Name: username_required
    Text: "B\u1EAFt bu\u1ED9c ph\u1EA3i nh\u1EADp t\xEAn ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\xF9ng!"
  - Name: username_too_short
    Text: "T\xEAn ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\xF9ng ph\u1EA3i c\xF3 \xEDt nh\u1EA5t 6 k\xFD
      t\u1EF1!"
  - Name: username_invalid
    Text: "T\xEAn ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\xF9ng ch\u1EC9 cho ph\xE9p ch\u1EEF c\xE1i, s\u1ED1
      v\xE0 d\u1EA5u g\u1EA1ch d\u01B0\u1EDBi!"
  - Name: password_required
    Text: "C\u1EA7n ph\u1EA3i nh\u1EADp m\u1EADt kh\u1EA9u!"
  - Name: password_too_short
    Text: "M\u1EADt kh\u1EA9u ph\u1EA3i c\xF3 \xEDt nh\u1EA5t 6 k\xFD t\u1EF1!"
  - Name: password_and_repassword_not_same
    Text: "M\u1EADt kh\u1EA9u v\xE0 m\u1EADt kh\u1EA9u m\u1EDBi kh\xF4ng gi\u1ED1ng
      nhau!"
  - Name: password_too_short
    Text: "M\u1EADt kh\u1EA9u ph\u1EA3i c\xF3 \xEDt nh\u1EA5t 6 k\xFD t\u1EF1!"
  - Name: repassword_required
    Text: "C\u1EA7n ph\u1EA3i nh\u1EADp l\u1EA1i m\u1EADt kh\u1EA9u!"
  - Name: data_error
    Text: "K\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i kh\xF4ng \u1ED5n \u0111\u1ECBnh. Vui l\xF2ng th\u1EED
      l\u1EA1i sau v\xE0i ph\xFAt!"
  - Name: card_player_over_player_level
    Text: "\u0110\u1ED3ng \u0111\u1ED9i Echo ch\u1EC9 c\xF3 th\u1EC3 l\xEAn c\u1EA5p
      t\u01B0\u01A1ng \u1EE9ng v\u1EDBi c\u1EA5p \u0111\u1ED9 c\u1EE7a Anh h\xF9ng
      c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n!"
  - Name: card_player_max_level
    Text: "Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi b\u1EA1n \u0111\u1ED3ng h\xE0nh Echo n\xE0y \u0111\xE3
      \u0111\u1EA1t \u0111\u1EBFn c\u1EA5p \u0111\u1ED9 t\u1ED1i \u0111a!"
  - Name: card_player_max_star
    Text: "Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi b\u1EA1n \u0111\u1ED3ng h\xE0nh Echo n\xE0y \u0111\xE3
      \u0111\u1EA1t \u0111\u1EBFn ng\xF4i sao t\u1ED1i \u0111a!"
  - Name: cooldown_join_new_clan
    Text: "B\u1EA1n ph\u1EA3i \u0111\u1EE3i {0} tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi tham gia v\xE0o
      m\u1ED9t gia t\u1ED9c kh\xE1c!"
  - Name: cooldown_join_new_clan_title
    Text: "L\u1EDDi th\u1EC1 ki\xEAn nh\u1EABn"
  - Name: deck_full_des
    Text: "\u0110\u1ED9i h\xECnh c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1EA7y. B\u1EA1n
      ch\u1EC9 c\xF3 th\u1EC3 c\xF3 5 qu\xE1i v\u1EADt tr\xEAn chi\u1EBFn tr\u01B0\u1EDDng."
  - Name: deck_full_title
    Text: "\u0110\u1ED9i h\xECnh \u0111\u1EA7y \u0111\u1EE7"
  - Name: lock_title
    Text: "T\xEDnh n\u0103ng b\u1ECB kh\xF3a"
  - Name: unlock_feature
    Text: "T\xEDnh n\u0103ng m\u1EDF kh\xF3a \u1EDF C\u1EA5p \u0111\u1ED9 {0}"
  - Name: Your game version is outdated. Please update to the latest version to continue
      playing.
    Text: "Phi\xEAn b\u1EA3n tr\xF2 ch\u01A1i c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 l\u1ED7i
      th\u1EDDi. Vui l\xF2ng c\u1EADp nh\u1EADt l\xEAn phi\xEAn b\u1EA3n m\u1EDBi
      nh\u1EA5t \u0111\u1EC3 ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c ch\u01A1i."
  - Name: error_while_sending
    Text: "K\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i kh\xF4ng \u1ED5n \u0111\u1ECBnh. Vui l\xF2ng th\u1EED
      l\u1EA1i!"
  - Name: error_while_sending_title
    Text: "K\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i kh\xF4ng \u1ED5n \u0111\u1ECBnh"
  - Name: evolve_confirm_title
    Text: "Ti\u1EBFn h\xF3a Echo"
  - Name: evolve_confirm_content
    Text: "Echo c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n s\u1EAFp th\u0103ng l\xEAn m\u1ED9t h\xECnh th\xE1i
      cao h\u01A1n. S\u1EF1 ti\u1EBFn h\xF3a n\xE0y l\xE0 kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 \u0111\u1EA3o
      ng\u01B0\u1EE3c. B\u1EA1n c\xF3 mu\u1ED1n ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c kh\xF4ng?"
  - Name: location_service_title
    Text: "Gi\u1EA3i ph\xF3ng cu\u1ED9c phi\xEAu l\u01B0u!"
  - Name: location_service_detail
    Text: "H\xE3y b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u m\u1ED9t nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EE5 ho\xE0nh tr\xE1ng
      v\u1EDBi nh\u1EEFng tr\u1EADn chi\u1EBFn ly k\u1EF3 v\xE0 kho b\xE1u \u1EA9n
      gi\u1EA5u! \u0110\u1EC3 n\xE2ng cao tr\u1EA3i nghi\u1EC7m ch\u01A1i game c\u1EE7a
      b\u1EA1n, ch\xFAng t\xF4i y\xEAu c\u1EA7u b\u1EA1n c\u1EA5p quy\u1EC1n truy
      c\u1EADp v\u1ECB tr\xED c\u1EE7a m\xECnh. \u0110i\u1EC1u n\xE0y s\u1EBD cho
      ph\xE9p ch\xFAng t\xF4i gi\u1EA3i ph\xF3ng qu\xE1i v\u1EADt g\u1EA7n \u0111\xF3
      v\xE0 h\xE9 l\u1ED9 nh\u1EEFng Astral b\xED \u1EA9n. \r\nV\xEC v\u1EADy, h\xE3y
      chu\u1EA9n b\u1ECB tinh th\u1EA7n cho nh\u1EEFng tr\u1EADn chi\u1EBFn h\xE0nh
      \u0111\u1ED9ng ngh\u1EB9t th\u1EDF ch\u1ED1ng l\u1EA1i qu\xE1i v\u1EADt \u1EA9n
      n\xFAp xung quanh b\u1EA1n! S\u1EED d\u1EE5ng Astral \u0111\u1EC3 du h\xE0nh
      \u0111\u1EBFn nh\u1EEFng v\xF9ng \u0111\u1EA5t m\u1EDBi \u0111\u1EA7y th\xFA
      v\u1ECB v\xE0 th\u1EED th\xE1ch! B\u1EADt ch\u1EEF in hoa cho ph\xE9p b\u1EA1n
      b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u cu\u1ED9c phi\xEAu l\u01B0u kh\xF3 qu\xEAn n\xE0y. B\u1EA1n
      lu\xF4n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 \u0111i\u1EC1u ch\u1EC9nh c\xE0i \u0111\u1EB7t v\u1ECB
      tr\xED sau."
  - Name: adv_reach_cap
    Text: "B\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1EA1t \u0111\u1EBFn gi\u1EDBi h\u1EA1n qu\u1EA3ng
      c\xE1o h\xE0ng ng\xE0y!"
  - Name: delete_account_title
    Text: "X\xF3a t\xE0i kho\u1EA3n"
  - Name: delete_account_des
    Text: "*H\xE0nh \u0111\u1ED9ng n\xE0y s\u1EBD x\xF3a v\u0129nh vi\u1EC5n t\xE0i
      kho\u1EA3n c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n v\xE0 m\u1ECDi ti\u1EBFn tr\xECnh. Kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3
      ho\xE0n t\xE1c.*"
  - Name: delete_account_ask
    Text: "Thao t\xE1c n\xE0y s\u1EBD x\xF3a v\u0129nh vi\u1EC5n t\xE0i kho\u1EA3n
      v\xE0 m\u1ECDi ti\u1EBFn tr\xECnh c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n. Kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 ho\xE0n
      t\xE1c. B\u1EA1n c\xF3 ch\u1EAFc ch\u1EAFn mu\u1ED1n ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c kh\xF4ng?"
  - Name: delete_account_not_link
    Text: "Vui l\xF2ng li\xEAn k\u1EBFt t\xE0i kho\u1EA3n Myrk c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n
      \u0111\u1EC3 ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c!"
  - Name: restore_iap_success
    Text: "Kh\xF4i ph\u1EE5c th\xE0nh c\xF4ng!"
  - Name: restore_iap_title
    Text: "Kh\xF4i ph\u1EE5c giao d\u1ECBch mua"
  - Name: restore_iap_content
    Text: "B\u1EA1n c\xF3 ch\u1EAFc ch\u1EAFn mu\u1ED1n kh\xF4i ph\u1EE5c c\xE1c
      giao d\u1ECBch mua c\u1EE7a m\xECnh kh\xF4ng?"
  - Name: link_google_play_title
    Text: "Li\xEAn k\u1EBFt Google Play"
  - Name: link_google_play_content
    Text: "B\u1EA1n c\xF3 ch\u1EAFc ch\u1EAFn mu\u1ED1n li\xEAn k\u1EBFt t\xE0i kho\u1EA3n
      Google Play c\u1EE7a m\xECnh kh\xF4ng?"
  - Name: linked_google_play_notic
    Text: "T\xE0i kho\u1EA3n Google Play {0} c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      li\xEAn k\u1EBFt th\xE0nh c\xF4ng."
  - Name: link_google_play_error_title
    Text: "Li\xEAn k\u1EBFt Google Play"
  - Name: link_google_play_error_content
    Text: "Kh\xF4ng li\xEAn k\u1EBFt \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c t\xE0i kho\u1EA3n Google
      Play"
  - Name: un_link_google_play_error_title
    Text: "H\u1EE7y li\xEAn k\u1EBFt Google Play"
  - Name: un_link_google_play_error_content
    Text: "Kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 h\u1EE7y li\xEAn k\u1EBFt t\xE0i kho\u1EA3n Google Play"
  - Name: unlink_google_play_title
    Text: "H\u1EE7y li\xEAn k\u1EBFt Google Play"
  - Name: unlink_google_play_notic
    Text: "B\u1EA1n c\xF3 ch\u1EAFc ch\u1EAFn mu\u1ED1n h\u1EE7y li\xEAn k\u1EBFt
      t\xE0i kho\u1EA3n Google Play {0} c\u1EE7a m\xECnh kh\xF4ng?"
  - Name: linked_game_center_notic
    Text: "T\xE0i kho\u1EA3n Game Center {0} c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      li\xEAn k\u1EBFt th\xE0nh c\xF4ng."
  - Name: link_game_center_title
    Text: "Trung t\xE2m tr\xF2 ch\u01A1i li\xEAn k\u1EBFt"
  - Name: link_game_center_content
    Text: "B\u1EA1n c\xF3 ch\u1EAFc ch\u1EAFn mu\u1ED1n li\xEAn k\u1EBFt t\xE0i kho\u1EA3n
      Game Center c\u1EE7a m\xECnh kh\xF4ng?"
  - Name: linked_game_center_notic
    Text: "T\xE0i kho\u1EA3n Game Center {0} c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      li\xEAn k\u1EBFt th\xE0nh c\xF4ng."
  - Name: get_system_fail_title
    Text: "D\u1EEF li\u1EC7u h\u1EC7 th\u1ED1ng b\u1ECB l\u1ED7i"
  - Name: get_system_fail_des
    Text: "D\u1EEF li\u1EC7u h\u1EC7 th\u1ED1ng b\u1ECB l\u1ED7i. Vui l\xF2ng ki\u1EC3m
      tra k\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i v\xE0 th\u1EED l\u1EA1i. N\u1EBFu s\u1EF1 c\u1ED1 v\u1EABn
      ti\u1EBFp di\u1EC5n, vui l\xF2ng li\xEAn h\u1EC7 b\u1ED9 ph\u1EADn h\u1ED7
      tr\u1EE3."
  - Name: login_fail
    Text: "\u0110\u0103ng nh\u1EADp kh\xF4ng th\xE0nh c\xF4ng. Vui l\xF2ng ki\u1EC3m
      tra k\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i v\xE0 th\u1EED l\u1EA1i!"
  - Name: register_fail
    Text: "\u0110\u0103ng k\xFD kh\xF4ng th\xE0nh c\xF4ng. Vui l\xF2ng ki\u1EC3m
      tra k\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i v\xE0 th\u1EED l\u1EA1i!"
  - Name: notification_maintenance_warning
    Text: "B\u1EA3o tr\xEC s\u1EBD b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u sau {0} ph\xFAt n\u1EEFa.
      Vui l\xF2ng \u0111\u0103ng xu\u1EA5t \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u1EA3m b\u1EA3o ti\u1EBFn
      tr\xECnh v\xE0 giao d\u1ECBch c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c l\u01B0u
      an to\xE0n."
