    Text: "M\u1EA3nh v\u1EE1 Myrvok"
  - Name: item_insufficient_1
    Text: "B\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng c\xF3 \u0111\u1EE7 V\xE0ng {0}!"
  - Name: item_insufficient_2
    Text: "B\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng c\xF3 \u0111\u1EE7 N\u0103ng l\u01B0\u1EE3ng {0}!"
  - Name: item_insufficient_3
    Text: "B\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng c\xF3 \u0111\u1EE7 \u0110\xE1 qu\xFD {0}!"
  - Name: item_insufficient_4
    Text: "B\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng c\xF3 \u0111\u1EE7 M\xE3 tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i {0}!"
  - Name: item_insufficient_5
    Text: "B\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng c\xF3 \u0111\u1EE7 Ti\u1EC1n danh d\u1EF1 {0}!"
  - Name: item_insufficient_6
    Text: "B\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng c\xF3 \u0111\u1EE7 \u0110\xE1 trang b\u1ECB {0}!"
  - Name: item_insufficient_7
    Text: "B\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng c\xF3 \u0111\u1EE7 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i Exp {0}!"
  - Name: item_insufficient_8
    Text: "B\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng c\xF3 \u0111\u1EE7 V\xE9 tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i th\xF4ng
      th\u01B0\u1EDDng {0}!"
  - Name: item_insufficient_9
    Text: "B\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng c\xF3 \u0111\u1EE7 V\xE9 tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i cao c\u1EA5p
      {0}!"
  - Name: item_insufficient_10
    Text: "B\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng c\xF3 \u0111\u1EE7 V\xE9 tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i si\xEAu
      c\u1EA5p {0}!"
  - Name: item_insufficient_11
    Text: "B\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng c\xF3 \u0111\u1EE7 Th\u1ECBt {0}!"
  - Name: item_insufficient_12
    Text: "B\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng c\xF3 \u0111\u1EE7 Ch\xECa kh\xF3a C\u1ED5ng Astral
      {0}!"
  - Name: item_insufficient_13
    Text: "B\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng c\xF3 \u0111\u1EE7 R\u01B0\u01A1ng du h\xE0nh {0}!"
  - Name: item_insufficient_14
    Text: "B\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng c\xF3 \u0111\u1EE7 R\u01B0\u01A1ng Hi\u1EC7p s\u0129
      {0}!"
  - Name: item_insufficient_15
    Text: "B\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng c\xF3 \u0111\u1EE7 R\u01B0\u01A1ng anh h\xF9ng {0}!"
  - Name: item_insufficient_16
    Text: "B\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng c\xF3 \u0111\u1EE7 R\u01B0\u01A1ng qu\u1EF7 {0}!"
  - Name: item_insufficient_17
    Text: "B\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng c\xF3 \u0111\u1EE7 kinh nghi\u1EC7m l\xE0m ch\u1EE7
      r\u01B0\u01A1ng {0}!"
  - Name: item_insufficient_18
    Text: "B\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng c\xF3 \u0111\u1EE7 Ng\xF4i sao chi\u1EBFn \u0111\u1EA5u
      {0}!"
  - Name: item_des_1
    Text: "Ti\u1EC1n t\u1EC7 ch\xEDnh \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng tr\xEAn
      to\xE0n v\u01B0\u01A1ng qu\u1ED1c. D\xF9ng n\xF3 \u0111\u1EC3 n\xE2ng c\u1EA5p
      anh h\xF9ng, mua trang b\u1ECB ho\u1EB7c giao d\u1ECBch v\u1EDBi th\u01B0\u01A1ng
      nh\xE2n."
  - Name: item_des_2
    Text: "C\u1EA7n thi\u1EBFt \u0111\u1EC3 th\u1EF1c hi\u1EC7n nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EE5,
      tr\u1EADn chi\u1EBFn ho\u1EB7c ng\u1EE5c t\u1ED1i. T\xE1i t\u1EA1o theo th\u1EDDi
      gian (m\u1ED7i 30 ph\xFAt cho m\u1ED9t l\u1EA7n) ho\u1EB7c c\xF3 th\u1EC3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      n\u1EA1p l\u1EA1i b\u1EB1ng c\xE1c v\u1EADt ph\u1EA9m \u0111\u1EB7c bi\u1EC7t."
  - Name: item_des_3
    Text: "M\u1ED9t m\xF3n \u0103n m\u1EEBng gi\xFAp n\xE2ng cao tinh th\u1EA7n.
      D\xF9ng \u0111\u1EC3 ph\u1EE5c h\u1ED3i th\u1EC3 l\u1EF1c ho\u1EB7c t\u0103ng
      t\xECnh c\u1EA3m v\u1EDBi c\xE1c nh\xE2n v\u1EADt trong c\xE1c s\u1EF1 ki\u1EC7n
      \u0111\u1EB7c bi\u1EC7t."
  - Name: item_des_4
    Text: "M\u1ED9t lo\u1EA1i ti\u1EC1n t\u1EC7 cao c\u1EA5p. S\u1EED d\u1EE5ng n\xF3
      \u0111\u1EC3 tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i anh h\xF9ng hi\u1EBFm, mua v\u1EADt ph\u1EA9m
      \u0111\u1ED9c quy\u1EC1n ho\u1EB7c t\u0103ng t\u1ED1c ti\u1EBFn tr\xECnh."
  - Name: item_des_5
    Text: "M\u1ED9t \u0111\u1ED3ng xu th\u1EA7n b\xED \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c s\u1EED
      d\u1EE5ng t\u1EA1i b\xE0n th\u1EDD tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i \u0111\u1EC3 tri\u1EC7u
      h\u1ED3i c\xE1c anh h\xF9ng ho\u1EB7c sinh v\u1EADt t\u1EEB th\u1EBF gi\u1EDBi
      b\xEAn kia."
  - Name: item_des_7
    Text: "Ki\u1EBFm \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c th\xF4ng qua c\xE1c tr\u1EADn chi\u1EBFn
      PvP v\xE0 s\u1EF1 ki\u1EC7n bang h\u1ED9i. \u0110\u1ED5i ch\xFAng \u0111\u1EC3
      l\u1EA5y ph\u1EA7n th\u01B0\u1EDFng \u0111\u1ED9c \u0111\xE1o v\xE0 nh\xE2n
      v\u1EADt \u01B0u t\xFA."
  - Name: item_des_8
    Text: "M\u1ED9t m\u1EA3nh v\u1EE1 ma thu\u1EADt \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c truy\u1EC1n
      n\u0103ng l\u01B0\u1EE3ng r\xE8n. D\xF9ng \u0111\u1EC3 c\u01B0\u1EDDng h\xF3a
      ho\u1EB7c ch\u1EBF t\u1EA1o trang b\u1ECB cho anh h\xF9ng c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n."
  - Name: item_des_9
    Text: "Kinh nghi\u1EC7m d\xF9ng \u0111\u1EC3 n\xE2ng c\u1EA5p Anh h\xF9ng c\u1EE7a
      b\u1EA1n. Ki\u1EBFm \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c th\xF4ng qua chi\u1EBFn th\u1EAFng
      trong chi\u1EBFn \u0111\u1EA5u."
  - Name: item_des_12
    Text: "M\u1ED9t v\xE9 c\u01A1 b\u1EA3n c\u1EA5p m\u1ED9t m\u1EA3nh ng\u1EABu
      nhi\xEAn v\u1EDBi m\u1ED9t c\u01A1 h\u1ED9i nh\u1ECF c\xF3 th\u1EC3 nh\u1EADn
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c nhi\u1EC1u h\u01A1n."
  - Name: item_des_13
    Text: "M\u1ED9t t\u1EA5m v\xE9 cao c\u1EA5p c\xF3 m\u1ED9t l\u01B0\u1EE3ng m\u1EA3nh
      v\u1EE1 v\u1EEBa ph\u1EA3i v\u1EDBi c\u01A1 h\u1ED9i nh\u1EADn \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      ph\u1EA7n th\u01B0\u1EDFng l\u1EDBn h\u01A1n."
  - Name: item_des_14
    Text: "V\xE9 tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i t\u1ED1i th\u01B0\u1EE3ng cung c\u1EA5p m\u1ED9t
      l\u01B0\u1EE3ng l\u1EDBn m\u1EA3nh v\u1EE1 c\xF3 kh\u1EA3 n\u0103ng mang l\u1EA1i
      ph\u1EA7n th\u01B0\u1EDFng m\u1EA3nh v\u1EE1 l\u1EDBn nh\u1EA5t."
  - Name: item_des_15
    Text: "Th\u1ECBt \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c t\u1EA9m tinh ch\u1EA5t huy\u1EC1n b\xED
      nu\xF4i d\u01B0\u1EE1ng linh h\u1ED3n qu\xE1i th\xFA. Cho qu\xE1i th\xFA \u0103n
      \u0111\u1EC3 l\xEAn c\u1EA5p v\xE0 tr\u1EDF n\xEAn m\u1EA1nh m\u1EBD h\u01A1n."
  - Name: item_des_16
    Text: "M\u1EDF kh\xF3a quy\u1EC1n truy c\u1EADp v\xE0o ng\u1EE5c t\u1ED1i \u0111\u1EB7c
      bi\u1EC7t, s\u1EF1 ki\u1EC7n c\xF3 gi\u1EDBi h\u1EA1n th\u1EDDi gian ho\u1EB7c
      \u0111\u1ED9t k\xEDch tr\xF9m. C\u1EA7n thi\u1EBFt \u0111\u1EC3 gi\xE0nh \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      chi\u1EBFn l\u1EE3i ph\u1EA9m v\xE0 th\u1EED th\xE1ch c\u1EA5p cao."
  - Name: item_des_17
    Text: "M\u1ED9t chi\u1EBFc r\u01B0\u01A1ng g\u1ED7 \u0111\u01A1n gi\u1EA3n ch\u1EE9a
      c\xE1c v\u1EADt ph\u1EA9m c\u01A1 b\u1EA3n. Bao g\u1ED3m m\u1ED9t l\u01B0\u1EE3ng
      nh\u1ECF ti\u1EC1n xu, \u0111\xE1 trang b\u1ECB v\xE0 m\u1EA3nh qu\xE1i v\u1EADt.
      Ho\xE0n h\u1EA3o cho giai \u0111o\u1EA1n \u0111\u1EA7u."
  - Name: item_des_18
    Text: "R\u01B0\u01A1ng ti\xEAu chu\u1EA9n cung c\u1EA5p ph\u1EA7n th\u01B0\u1EDFng
      n\xE2ng cao. Ch\u1EE9a nhi\u1EC1u ti\u1EC1n xu h\u01A1n, \u0111\xE1 trang b\u1ECB
      n\xE2ng c\u1EA5p v\xE0 m\u1EA3nh qu\xE1i v\u1EADt."
  - Name: item_des_19
    Text: "M\u1ED9t chi\u1EBFc r\u01B0\u01A1ng qu\xFD gi\xE1 ch\u1EE9a \u0111\u1EA7y
      c\u1EE7a c\u1EA3i. C\xF3 th\u1EC3 nh\u1EADn \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c m\u1ED9t l\u01B0\u1EE3ng
      l\u1EDBn ti\u1EC1n xu, \u0111\xE1 trang b\u1ECB cao c\u1EA5p v\xE0 m\u1EA3nh
      qu\xE1i v\u1EADt."
  - Name: item_des_20
    Text: "R\u01B0\u01A1ng kho b\xE1u h\xE0ng \u0111\u1EA7u. Ch\u1EE9a m\u1ED9t l\u01B0\u1EE3ng
      l\u1EDBn ti\u1EC1n xu, \u0111\xE1 trang b\u1ECB v\xE0 m\u1EA3nh qu\xE1i v\u1EADt."
  - Name: item_des_21
    Text: "Kinh nghi\u1EC7m nh\u1EADn \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c khi m\u1EDF r\u01B0\u01A1ng.
      T\xEDch l\u0169y R\u01B0\u01A1ng EXP s\u1EBD t\u0103ng C\u1EA5p \u0111\u1ED9
      th\xE0nh th\u1EA1o R\u01B0\u01A1ng c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n - mang l\u1EA1i ph\u1EA7n
      th\u01B0\u1EDFng t\u1ED1t h\u01A1n t\u1EEB R\u01B0\u01A1ng."
  - Name: item_des_22
    Text: "Nh\u1EEFng ng\xF4i sao r\u1EF1c r\u1EE1 n\xE0y l\xE0 bi\u1EC3u t\u01B0\u1EE3ng
      cho l\xF2ng d\u0169ng c\u1EA3m c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n trong tr\u1EADn chi\u1EBFn
      - h\xE3y thu th\u1EADp ch\xFAng \u0111\u1EC3 v\u01B0\u1EE3t qua c\xE1c m\u1ED1c
      quan tr\u1ECDng c\u1EE7a Battle Pass v\xE0 gi\xE0nh \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c kho
      b\xE1u \u0111\u1ED9c quy\u1EC1n."
  - Name: item_des_23
    Text: "D\xF9ng \u0111\u1EC3 th\xE1ch \u0111\u1EA5u \u0111\u1ED1i th\u1EE7 trong
      \u0110\u1EA5u tr\u01B0\u1EDDng. M\u1ED7i tr\u1EADn \u0111\u1EA5u ti\xEAu t\u1ED1n
      m\u1ED9t v\xE9. V\xE9 s\u1EBD t\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED9ng h\u1ED3i ph\u1EE5c sau
      m\u1ED7i gi\u1EDD."
  - Name: item_des_1000
    Text: "M\u1ED9t l\xE1 b\xE0i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c truy\u1EC1n tinh hoa c\u1EE7a
      Wyrmote. H\xE3y d\xE2ng n\xF3 l\xEAn B\u1EC7 Th\u1EDD Tri\u1EC7u H\u1ED3i \u0111\u1EC3
      tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i qu\xE1i th\xFA \u0111\u1ED9c nh\u1EA5t n\xE0y chi\u1EBFn
      \u0111\u1EA5u b\xEAn c\u1EA1nh b\u1EA1n. Ch\u1EC9 nh\u1EEFng ai s\u1EDF h\u1EEFu
      l\xE1 b\xE0i n\xE0y m\u1EDBi c\xF3 th\u1EC3 t\u1EA1o n\xEAn m\u1ED1i li\xEAn
      k\u1EBFt v\u1EDBi qu\xE1i th\xFA."
  - Name: item_des_1001
    Text: "M\u1ED9t l\xE1 b\xE0i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c truy\u1EC1n tinh hoa c\u1EE7a
      Twynthrax. H\xE3y d\xE2ng n\xF3 l\xEAn B\u1EC7 Th\u1EDD Tri\u1EC7u H\u1ED3i
      \u0111\u1EC3 tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i qu\xE1i th\xFA \u0111\u1ED9c nh\u1EA5t n\xE0y
      chi\u1EBFn \u0111\u1EA5u b\xEAn c\u1EA1nh b\u1EA1n. Ch\u1EC9 nh\u1EEFng ai
      s\u1EDF h\u1EEFu l\xE1 b\xE0i n\xE0y m\u1EDBi c\xF3 th\u1EC3 t\u1EA1o n\xEAn
      m\u1ED1i li\xEAn k\u1EBFt v\u1EDBi qu\xE1i th\xFA."
  - Name: item_des_1002
    Text: "M\u1ED9t l\xE1 b\xE0i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c truy\u1EC1n tinh hoa c\u1EE7a
      Triphyrex. H\xE3y d\xE2ng n\xF3 l\xEAn B\u1EC7 Th\u1EDD Tri\u1EC7u H\u1ED3i
      \u0111\u1EC3 tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i qu\xE1i th\xFA \u0111\u1ED9c nh\u1EA5t n\xE0y
      chi\u1EBFn \u0111\u1EA5u b\xEAn c\u1EA1nh b\u1EA1n. Ch\u1EC9 nh\u1EEFng ai
      s\u1EDF h\u1EEFu l\xE1 b\xE0i n\xE0y m\u1EDBi c\xF3 th\u1EC3 t\u1EA1o n\xEAn
      m\u1ED1i li\xEAn k\u1EBFt v\u1EDBi qu\xE1i th\xFA."
  - Name: item_des_1003
    Text: "M\u1ED9t l\xE1 b\xE0i th\u1EA5m \u0111\u1EABm tinh hoa c\u1EE7a Bruisic.
      H\xE3y d\xE2ng n\xF3 l\xEAn B\u1EC7 Th\u1EDD Tri\u1EC7u H\u1ED3i \u0111\u1EC3
      tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i qu\xE1i th\xFA \u0111\u1ED9c nh\u1EA5t n\xE0y chi\u1EBFn
      \u0111\u1EA5u b\xEAn c\u1EA1nh b\u1EA1n. Ch\u1EC9 nh\u1EEFng ai s\u1EDF h\u1EEFu
      l\xE1 b\xE0i n\xE0y m\u1EDBi c\xF3 th\u1EC3 t\u1EA1o n\xEAn m\u1ED1i li\xEAn
      k\u1EBFt v\u1EDBi qu\xE1i th\xFA."
  - Name: item_des_1004
    Text: "M\u1ED9t l\xE1 b\xE0i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c truy\u1EC1n tinh hoa c\u1EE7a
      Bradiate. H\xE3y d\xE2ng n\xF3 l\xEAn B\u1EC7 Th\u1EDD Tri\u1EC7u H\u1ED3i
      \u0111\u1EC3 tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i qu\xE1i th\xFA \u0111\u1ED9c nh\u1EA5t n\xE0y
      chi\u1EBFn \u0111\u1EA5u b\xEAn c\u1EA1nh b\u1EA1n. Ch\u1EC9 nh\u1EEFng ai
      s\u1EDF h\u1EEFu l\xE1 b\xE0i n\xE0y m\u1EDBi c\xF3 th\u1EC3 t\u1EA1o n\xEAn
      m\u1ED1i li\xEAn k\u1EBFt v\u1EDBi qu\xE1i th\xFA."
  - Name: item_des_1005
    Text: "M\u1ED9t l\xE1 b\xE0i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c truy\u1EC1n tinh hoa c\u1EE7a
      Brutoxar. H\xE3y d\xE2ng n\xF3 l\xEAn B\u1EC7 Th\u1EDD Tri\u1EC7u H\u1ED3i
      \u0111\u1EC3 tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i qu\xE1i th\xFA \u0111\u1ED9c nh\u1EA5t n\xE0y
      chi\u1EBFn \u0111\u1EA5u b\xEAn c\u1EA1nh b\u1EA1n. Ch\u1EC9 nh\u1EEFng ai
      s\u1EDF h\u1EEFu l\xE1 b\xE0i n\xE0y m\u1EDBi c\xF3 th\u1EC3 t\u1EA1o n\xEAn
      m\u1ED1i li\xEAn k\u1EBFt v\u1EDBi qu\xE1i th\xFA."
  - Name: item_des_1006
    Text: "M\u1ED9t l\xE1 b\xE0i th\u1EA5m \u0111\u1EABm tinh hoa c\u1EE7a Fluffalo.
      H\xE3y d\xE2ng n\xF3 l\xEAn B\u1EC7 Th\u1EDD Tri\u1EC7u H\u1ED3i \u0111\u1EC3
      tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i qu\xE1i th\xFA \u0111\u1ED9c nh\u1EA5t n\xE0y chi\u1EBFn
      \u0111\u1EA5u b\xEAn c\u1EA1nh b\u1EA1n. Ch\u1EC9 nh\u1EEFng ai s\u1EDF h\u1EEFu
      l\xE1 b\xE0i n\xE0y m\u1EDBi c\xF3 th\u1EC3 t\u1EA1o n\xEAn m\u1ED1i li\xEAn
      k\u1EBFt v\u1EDBi qu\xE1i th\xFA."
  - Name: item_des_1007
    Text: "M\u1ED9t l\xE1 b\xE0i th\u1EA5m \u0111\u1EABm tinh hoa c\u1EE7a Blazuff.
      H\xE3y d\xE2ng n\xF3 l\xEAn B\u1EC7 Th\u1EDD Tri\u1EC7u H\u1ED3i \u0111\u1EC3
      tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i qu\xE1i th\xFA \u0111\u1ED9c nh\u1EA5t n\xE0y chi\u1EBFn
      \u0111\u1EA5u b\xEAn c\u1EA1nh b\u1EA1n. Ch\u1EC9 nh\u1EEFng ai s\u1EDF h\u1EEFu
      l\xE1 b\xE0i n\xE0y m\u1EDBi c\xF3 th\u1EC3 t\u1EA1o n\xEAn m\u1ED1i li\xEAn
      k\u1EBFt v\u1EDBi qu\xE1i th\xFA."
  - Name: item_des_1008
    Text: "M\u1ED9t l\xE1 b\xE0i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c truy\u1EC1n tinh hoa c\u1EE7a
      Pyronox. H\xE3y d\xE2ng n\xF3 l\xEAn B\u1EC7 Th\u1EDD Tri\u1EC7u H\u1ED3i \u0111\u1EC3
      tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i qu\xE1i th\xFA \u0111\u1ED9c nh\u1EA5t n\xE0y chi\u1EBFn
      \u0111\u1EA5u b\xEAn c\u1EA1nh b\u1EA1n. Ch\u1EC9 nh\u1EEFng ai s\u1EDF h\u1EEFu
      l\xE1 b\xE0i n\xE0y m\u1EDBi c\xF3 th\u1EC3 t\u1EA1o n\xEAn m\u1ED1i li\xEAn
      k\u1EBFt v\u1EDBi qu\xE1i th\xFA."
  - Name: item_des_1009
    Text: "M\u1ED9t l\xE1 b\xE0i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c truy\u1EC1n tinh hoa c\u1EE7a
