  - Name: outpost_des_attack
    Text: Across the fractured lands, many Fortresses lie under enemy rule. Each
      Fortress you reclaim not only secures the realm but also increases your daily
      rewards. The more Fortresses you control, the greater your influence and spoils.
  - Name: outpost_des_reward
