  - Name: land
    Text: Land
  - Name: race_name_0
    Text: Gaia
  - Name: race_name_1
    Text: Mechtronic
  - Name: race_name_2
    Text: Nepharian
  - Name: race_name_3
    Text: Emberfolk
  - Name: race_name_4
    Text: Arcanian
  - Name: race_name_5
    Text: Shifterian
  - Name: race_detail_0
    Text: Inhabitants of Gaia, an Earth-like planet, these people have a deep connection
      with nature and animals. They communicate with animals and wield earth-based
      magic to manipulate the natural world.
  - Name: race_detail_1
    Text: A cybernetic race living on a high-tech planet with an advanced culture.
      Their bodies are mechanical constructs, robots, and AI. Their strength lies
      in their creativity and profound understanding of technology.
  - Name: race_detail_2
    Text: Aliens from a distant planet with harsh environments. They have blue skin
      and can harness the power of water elements. They are formidable and agile
      warriors in aquatic settings.
  - Name: race_detail_3
    Text: Residents of a tropical planet where heat and fire are integral to daily
      life. They can create and control fire, using it as magic or a weapon. Their
      sacred culture venerates deities associated with fire and heat.
  - Name: race_detail_4
    Text: A superior race capable of manipulating cosmic energy and magic. They live
      on a planet with a unique atmosphere that allows them to absorb energy and
      magic from stars and neighboring planets. They are wizards with limitless knowledge
      of the cosmos.
  - Name: race_detail_5
    Text: A race that can shape-shift and adapt their bodies as needed. They inhabit
      a planet facing various threats, and their transformative ability helps them
      survive and adapt to harsh conditions. They are versatile and adaptable, changing
      form to suit any situation.
