  - Name: skill_active_detail_16
    Text: Engulfs his hands in searing flame and strikes outward, unleashing a wave
      of fire that scorches all enemies for {0}% ATK damage and burning them for
      {1}% ATK per round for {2} rounds.
  - Name: skill_active_name_17
    Text: Earthfang Guillotine
  - Name: skill_active_detail_17
    Text: Unleashes a strike on the two enemies with the lowest HP, dealing {0}%
      ATK damage. Ignores Block. Inflicts bonus damage equal to {1}% of the target's
      missing HP (capped at {2}% ATK). If the target's HP is lower than the spider's,
      there is a {3}% chance to Stun them for {4} rounds.
  - Name: skill_active_name_18
    Text: Bullfire Smash
  - Name: skill_active_detail_18
    Text: Unleashes a blazing hammer strike on the front row, dealing {0}% ATK damage.
      Increase +{1}% ATK and +{2}% Armor Break for {3} rounds. Also deals bonus damage
      equal to {4}% of the target's Max HP (damage capped at {5}% ATK).
  - Name: skill_active_name_19
    Text: Inferno Hunt
  - Name: skill_active_detail_19
    Text: Unleashes a wave of scorching flames, dealing {0}% ATK damage to all enemies
      and reducing their Speed by {1} for {2} rounds.
  - Name: skill_active_name_20
    Text: Bonequake Roar
  - Name: skill_active_detail_20
    Text: Unleashes a thunderous roar infused with stormlight, dealing {0}% ATK damage
      to all enemies. Each target has a {1}% chance to be Stunned for {2} rounds
      and a {3}% chance to lose {4} Energy.
  - Name: skill_active_name_21
    Text: Inferno Hunt
  - Name: skill_active_detail_21
    Text: Unleashes a wave of scorching flames, dealing {0}% ATK damage to all enemies
      and reducing their Speed by {1} for {2} rounds.
  - Name: skill_active_name_22
    Text: Sylvan Benediction
  - Name: skill_active_detail_22
    Text: "Unleashes the blessing of the forest god, dealing {0}% ATK as DMG to all
      enemies and restoring HP equal to {1}% of ATK to all allies. Grants all allies
      Verdant Grace for {2} rounds. \r\nVerdant Grace: When a hero with Verdant Grace
      takes Critical DMG, they recover HP equal to {3}% of the caster\u2019s ATK.
      This effect is consumed after activation but can stack."
  - Name: gear_skill_active_name_1
