  - Name: gear_0_des
    Text: Golden strands that shimmer with the blessing of light. A symbol of the
      knight's unwavering faith and brilliance in battle.
  - Name: gear_1_des
    Text: Forged in the heart of a fallen star, this suit channels pure light into
      a near-impenetrable barrier.
  - Name: gear_2_des
    Text: Golden strands that shimmer with the blessing of light. A symbol of the
      knight's unwavering faith and brilliance in battle.
  - Name: gear_3_des
    Text: Once carried by Alliance defenders, the golden emblem shines to inspire
      courage and fortify allies.
  - Name: gear_4_des
    Text: Each crystal resonates with Gaia's essence, linking Scions and their companions
      in shared vitality and enduring strength.
  - Name: gear_5_des
    Text: Forged in Gaia's heart, it pulses with energy, strengthening the wearer's
      speed.
  - Name: gear_6_des
    Text: Recovered from the Ruins of Aeterna, these pages shimmer with forgotten
      Astral light, strengthening its team.
  - Name: gear_7_des
    Text: A brutal axe forged with bone, stone, and tribal runes. Passed down through
      chieftains, it strikes with primal fury and unrelenting vengeance.
  - Name: gear_8_des
    Text: Crafted from beast hide and reinforced with metal, this armor bears the
      scars of a hundred battles. Blessed by the tribe's war gods, it symbol of the
      patriarch.
  - Name: gear_9_des
    Text: Buzzing blue hair, said to be blessed by ocean spirits. Those who wear
      it are believed to channel the sea's strength and unwavering will.
  - Name: gear_10_des
    Text: Bearing the royal seal of the Veylor, a race that once fought beside the
      Scions as allies, this shield carries their legacy of honor and might.
  - Name: gear_11_des
    Text: Forged with emerald essence, it honors the Scions long gone who defended
      Gaia in her time of need.
  - Name: gear_12_des
    Text: Crafted in volcanic forges, this ring channels the fiery lifeblood of Pyraxis
      to embolden the wearer.
  - Name: gear_13_des
    Text: An aged script chronicling Gaia's first breaths. Its words steady the soul
      and guard the body.
  - Name: gear_14_des
    Text: A curved mechanical claw reinforced with adaptive blades. It slices with
      the precision of a scalpel and the ferocity of a beast.
  - Name: gear_15_des
    Text: Forged from reinforced alloys and powered by energy-cores, this crimson
      armor fuses brute strength with precise engineering.
  - Name: gear_16_des
    Text: Wild silver-white hair with energy rumored to surge to life when battle
      draws near. A signature of knights wired to the energy-core.
  - Name: gear_17_des
    Text: Bearing the mark of Whisperwood's ancient tree, it shields allies with
      the enduring strength of elemental spirits.
  - Name: gear_18_des
    Text: Golden gems linked together form a covenant of unity, granting endurance
      to those who fight side by side.
  - Name: gear_19_des
    Text: Forged in the lost Sanctum Viridias, this serpent-etched ring now carries
      a Sentinel's lost legacy.
  - Name: gear_20_des
    Text: Recovered from Sanctum Viridias before its fall, this script channels Sentinel
      wisdom into protective wards.
  - Name: gear_sub_upgrade
    Text: '**Upgrade your gear to boost your hero''s power**'
