  - Name: portal_title
    Text: Astral Gate
  - Name: portal_des
    Text: 'In the ancient lands of {0}, a celestial rift known as the Astral Gate
      awakens - a gate between realms where time itself trembles. Born of forgotten
      constellations and sealed by ancient guardians, it hums with the echoes of
      countless worlds long lost to history.

      When the Gate opens, the skies
      blaze with light, and from within emerges the Gatekeeper - a being forged of
      starlight and shadow, bound to test the courage of all who dare approach. Each
      strike against it echoes through the void, a trial not just of strength, but
      of resolve.'
  - Name: portal_unknow_local
    Text: Myrk
  - Name: portal_guide
    Text: "A mysterious gateway connecting two worlds. Inside awaits the Gatekeeper
      - a mighty guardian threatening your realm. The stronger the Gatekeeper, the
      greater the challenge\u2026 and the rewards.\r\n<size=70%><size=70%><sprite
      name=\"icon_portal_brown\"></size> </size>To enter, you must use a <b>Astral
      Gate Key</b>. <b>3 Astral Gate Keys</b> are restored daily at <b>00:00 (GMT+0)</b>.
      Unused keys <b>cannot be carried over</b> to the next day.\r\n<size=70%><sprite
      name=\"icon_portal_brown\"></size> Once opened, the gate <b>endures for 24
      hours</b>.\r\n<size=70%><sprite name=\"icon_portal_brown\"></size> Each challenge
      attempt <b>recovers every hour</b>, with a <b>maximum of 20 attempts</b> stored.\r\n<size=70%><sprite
      name=\"icon_portal_brown\"></size> The gate can be <b>reopened 1 hour</b> after
      it closes.\r\n<size=70%><sprite name=\"icon_portal_brown\"></size> <b>Rewards
      are sent via mail</b> after the Gatekeeper is defeated.\r\n<size=70%><sprite
      name=\"icon_portal_brown\"></size> <b>Battle rankings determine your final
      treasure</b> - only the most relentless will rise to the top before the gate
      vanishes."
