  - Name: item_des_1
    Text: The primary currency used across the realm. Spend it to upgrade heroes,
      purchase gear, or trade with merchants.
  - Name: item_des_2
    Text: Required to undertake missions, battles, or dungeons. Regenerates over
      time (every 30 minute per one) or can be refilled with special items.
  - Name: item_des_3
    Text: A celebratory treat that boosts morale. Used to restore stamina or increase
      affection with characters during special events.
  - Name: item_des_4
    Text: A premium currency. Use it to summon rare heroes, buy exclusive items,
      or accelerate progress.
  - Name: item_des_5
    Text: A mystical coin used at the summoning altar to call forth heroes or creatures
      from beyond.
  - Name: item_des_7
    Text: Earned through PvP battles and guild events. Exchange them for unique rewards
      and elite characters.
  - Name: item_des_8
    Text: A magical shard infused with forging energy. Used to enhance or craft equipment
      for your heroes.
  - Name: item_des_9
    Text: Experience used to level up your Hero.  Earned through victories in combat.
  - Name: item_des_12
    Text: A basic ticket that grants a random shard with a small chance of more.
  - Name: item_des_13
    Text: A premium ticket that a modest amount of shards with a chance for an even
      greater bounty.
  - Name: item_des_14
    Text: The ultimate Summon ticket providing a large amount of shards with the
      potential for the greatest shard bounty of all.
  - Name: item_des_15
    Text: Meat infused with mystical essence that nourishes a beast's soul. Feed
      it to your monster to level up and grow stronger.
  - Name: item_des_16
    Text: Unlocks access to special dungeons, timed events, or boss raids. Essential
      for high-level loot and challenges.
  - Name: item_des_17
    Text: A simple wooden chest containing basic loot. Includes a small amount of
      coins, gear stones, and monster shards. Perfect for early progress.
  - Name: item_des_18
    Text: A standard chest offering improved rewards. Contains more coins, upgraded
      gear stones, and monster shards.
  - Name: item_des_19
    Text: A valuable chest packed with riches. Grants a high amount of coins, advanced
      gear stones, and monster shards.
  - Name: item_des_20
    Text: A top-tier treasure chest. Contains a large supply of coins, gear stones,
      and monster shards.
  - Name: item_des_21
    Text: Experience gained when opening chests. Accumulating EXP Chest increases
      your Chest Proficiency Level - granting better rewards from Chests.
  - Name: item_des_22
    Text: These radiant stars are a symbol of your valor in battle - gather them
      to ascend Battle Pass milestones and earn exclusive treasures.
  - Name: item_des_23
    Text: Used to challenge opponents in the Arena. One ticket is consumed per battle.
      Tickets recover automatically every hour.
  - Name: item_des_1000
    Text: A card infused with the essence of Wyrmote. Offer it at the Summoning Altar
      to call forth this unique monster to fight by your side. Only those who hold
      this card can form a bond with the beast.
