    Text: Speed
  - Name: stat_name_3
    Text: Health
  - Name: stat_name_4
    Text: Force
  - Name: stat_des_0
    Text: Determines the amount of damage dealt to enemies.
  - Name: stat_des_1
    Text: Reduces the damage taken from enemy attacks.
  - Name: stat_des_2
    Text: Determines the order in which Echoes attack during a round.
  - Name: stat_des_3
    Text: Determines how much damage a hero can take before being defeated.
  - Name: hero_stats_title
    Text: Hero Attributes
  - Name: hero_stats_desc
    Text: '<b><sprite name="icon_might_flat"> Force:</b> Determines the hero''s base
      damage output in battle.

      <b><sprite name="icon_hp_flat"> Health:</b>
      Increases the team''s maximum health, helping them endure longer.

      <b><sprite
      name="icon_spd_flat"> Speed:</b> Improves the team''s speed, allowing them
      to act first in combat.



      <b><size=80%>**Health and Speed are shared
      with all monsters in the lineup, empowering the entire team.**</size></b>'
